<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1KI- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Akanahota Akakolongwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo chu Kutumbula cha akanahota akakolongw</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akanahota Akakolongwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Akan</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo chukutumbula cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akanahota Akakolongwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chukutumbula cha unahota nkolongwa na kitabo chuubhele chu unahota nkolongwa, makacho kikibha kitabo chimo kikolongwa hake. Kwa mala jhukutumbula ngikibhaghanichwa nu kubhehe itabo ibhele kuhumii mu Bibuliya jha Kiseputuaginte, lyenio ndi likibha lilaghano lya makacho hake mu kilonge cha Kigilike. Ade ngohe, amanyikana jhe achwa ghane jwakajhandike kitabo chukutumbula cha unahota nkolongwa na kitabo chuubhele cha akanahota nkolongwa, helahela ghane jwabhekite mupangilio ngita chiibhonekana. Jwajhandike itabo henge atumii majhandiko ghange gha makacho mu kujhandika kwake, dolekeya kitabo chukutumbula cha unahota nkolongwa mu chula jha 11:41 na mu chula jha 14:19 na mu chula jha 14:29 ngita hela milandanikilo ghulangii uchakaka gwenio. Helahela imanyikana jhe digha itabo henge pijhandikwa nu kubhekwa mupangilio gwake. Ibhonekana hotuhotu kubhehe ikakamilichwe kujhandikwa pala tu munahota nkolongwa Yekoniya palekekilwa kuhumii kuhamicho kwenio ku Babele mu chaka cha 561 kabula jhukubhelukwa Kilichitu. Ku nhwalo kilebhe chenio kichimulilwa mu chakaka mu kitabo chuubhele cha unahota nkolongwa mu chula jha 25:27. Akachome twe bha mambu gha Lilobhe lya Chapanga yane Bibuliya, bhijheketela kubhehe chehemo ngolongwa jha itabo henge ikajhandikwe mu yaka jhamahele kabula jha kipinde chenio.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chukutumbula cha unahota nkolongwa na kitabo chuubhele chu unahota nkolongwa ichimulila malobhe gha kila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele nuku Yuda kuhumii mu kipinde chu ulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Chelemane, kipinde chenio ilambo henge ibhele ikibha ighabhanike jhe. Itabo henge yoha ichimulila namuna unahota nkolongwa gwa Ichilahele chiukalombine nde na chiubhaghanika nu kubhehe akanahota akakolongwa bhabhele, kila ghumo nguukengima lyake lilihobholela, ade pala unahota ukolongwa gwenio puilepilila na ilambo henge na bhando bhake kuhamichilwa kuughene. Jwajhandika alingukiye upahina gwa kila unahota nkolongwa na Chapanga pange chakaka unkengimila Chapanga kiuchakaka amu ubhiche. Akanahota akakolongwa bhange bhakatehi ilebhe, “Yambone palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kitabo chuubhele chu unahota nkolongwa 18:3.” Helahela na akanahota akakolongwa bhange bhakatehi ilebhe, “Uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, kitabo chuubhele chu unahota nkolongwa, 21:2.” Jwajhandika itabo henge ichimulila chankate ulongoche gwa akanahota akakolongwa bhibhatehila ghambone palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga nu kulangii kubhehe bhakahotwii kwa kila kilambo ghighanhobholika kwa munahota nkolongwa gwabhe kwa Chapanga. Mu kitabo chuubhele chu unahota nkolongwa 17:7, tuchoma kubhehe Akaichilahele bhakapukilwe kwa makakala nu kupelekwa kuughene ngita akabhanda ku mihalo jhenje, “Ghatendika gheniya kunhwalo gwa yana ya Akaichilahele ikatehi uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.” Kabhele, “Bhinyinamila ichapanga yenge.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Kitabo kichimulila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane chaupatita unahota ukolongwa gwake, na ulongoche gwake chiubhila maghumba nde ku Ichilahele, mu chula jha 1 ade 11.</para>
  <para style="io">Kughabhanika ku unahota nkolongwa ghuku Ichilahele nu ku Yuda, na pakate jha akanahota akakolongwa bha ilambo henge ibhele, mu chula jha 12 ade 16.</para>
  <para style="io">Helahela kitabo kichimulila malobhe gha utumiche gwa nnondole jwa Chapanga Eliya, achwa mitaungano pakate jhake na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele, muchula jha 17 ade 19.</para>
  <para style="io">Kupehekeya kwa ulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele, kabhele malobhe gha akanahota akakolongwa bhange bhibhalongwicha palonge jhake pamonga na akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Yuda, mu chula jha 20 ade 22.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Munahota nkolongwa Daude mu ughogholo gwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Kipinde munahota nkolongwa Daude pakibha aghogholwike hake, akatumiche bhake ngabhampukita mabulangete ngoo, ata yene apatita jhe upyoo. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Yene, akatumiche bhake ngabhannobholila, “Manahota bhito, mbaha tumpalakiye kamwale jwangakongana na munalome antumikile nu kuntunja, agholoke paupele jhino, kupala ampe upyoo.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Peniya, ngabhapaliya kamwale jwa lembolembo mu kilambo choha chuku Ichilahele. Ngabhampata kamwale jhumo jwakemitwa Abishage jwahumila ku Shuname, ngabhampelika kwa munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Kamwale jwenio akibha lembolembo hake. Peniya, ngatumbwila kuntumikila nu kuntunja munahota nkolongwa, nambo munahota nkolongwa akagholwike nako jhe ngita nhwanamundo.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya apala kubhehe munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Kipinde chenio, Adoniya mwana jwa Daude, majhe mundo akemitwa Hagite, ngakiluya nu kukulonge, Nenga namaha munahota nkolongwa. Yene, ngakilenganikiya mutuka jhukuhutwa na falache na akahobhoke falache pamonga na bhando makome nhwano bhibhakibha nnonge jhake. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Nambo tatemundo Daude, akibha anawahi jhe kumpwatalii, ata kukunkonya kunhwalo ghane mitenda naha? Adoniya akibha kangombo jhuna kuhalala hake, akibha ankengima Abusolomu kukubhelukwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya ngajheketiina na Yoabu, mwana jwa Seluya na mpiya litambiko Abiyatale, na bheniya ngabhajheketila kuntangatila. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Nambo mpiya litambiko Sadoke na Benaya mwana jwa Yehoyada na nnondole Nasane na Shimei na Lei pamonga na akalonda bha Daude, bhakibha jhe upandi gwake.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Lichiko limo, Adoniya ngapiita litambiko lya limbelele na ng'ombi na matohe ghighahatite palighanga lya lijhoka, pahina na chembwe cha mache chikikemwa Enilogele. Ngabhalalika akalongo mundo bhoha mu litambiko lyenio, yana yoha ya munahota nkolongwa na akatumiche bhoha na ilongoche bha likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Nambo akannalike jhe nnondole Nasane na Benaya na akalonda bha munahota nkolongwa na Chelemane nnongomundo.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chelemane ilumikwa kubhehe munahota nkolongwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Kipinde chenie, Natane nganyendila Batesheba majhemundo Chelemane nu kunkonya, “Bho, nnyohine jhe kubhehe Adoniya mwana gwa Hagite, atekubhehe munahota nkolongwa gwito kone Daude imanyii ndeka nhwalo gwenio? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Ngohe, anda mipala kughombo ughome gwino, na gwa mwana gwino Chelemane ntende naha, <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />munyendele munahota nkolongwa Daude munkonye kubhehe, bho, manahota bhango, manahota nkolongwa, mukanapii jhe nenga natumiche bhino kukulonge, ‘Chakaka mwanango Chelemane nabhaha munahota nkolongwa na jwenie natama pikigoda chango chu unahota nkolongwa, ngohe, kibhii nike Adoniya kulongocha?’ ” <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Natane ngalonge kipinde chimpakulonge na manahota nkolongwa, nenga nanyingila nu kunnobholela kubhehe malobhe ghalongela ndi gha chakaka.<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Yene, Betesheba nganyendilila munahota nkolongwa kuchumbi chake kipinde munahota nkolongwa pakibha aghoime hake, na Abishage kubhoke ku Shuname akibha antunjita. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Betasheba ngalita makilikite nganyinamila munahota nkolongwa na munahota jwenio ngankonya, “Bho, mipala nike?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Betasheba ngajhangwila, “Manahota bhango, ngunapila ne natumiche bhino nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga jwino, kukulonge, ‘Mwana gwino Chelemane nalongocha kubhoke pango nenga, na naitama pikigoda chango chu ulongoche.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Nambo dola, Adoniya atekubhehe munahota nkolongwa, pamo nukubhehe mwe manahota makolongwa bhango mumanyii ndeka nhwalo gwenio. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Apiite matambiko ngoo gha ng'ombi na mambelele na matohe ghinakuhata na kuilalika yana ino inalome, pamonga na mpiya litambiko Abiasale na Yoabu kilongoche nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo, nambo ntumiche gwino Chelemane annalike jhe. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Na ngohe manahota bhango, munahota nkolongwa, Akaichilahele bhinnende mwenga, kupala malobholele jwapala kubhehe munahota nkolongwa chehemo jhino mwenga, manahota bhango munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Anda nukutenda jhe yene, anda nnyomwike manahota bhango, ne pamonga na mwanango Chelemane natubhalangilwa kubhehe bhinamalemwa.<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Kipinde Batesheba palongila na munahota nkolongwa, nnondole Nasane ngajhingila munyumba jha munahota nkolongwa jwenio. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Na bhando ngabhannobholila munahota nkolongwa kubhehe, “Nnondole Nasane abhii pahina.” Nasane pajhingila unyumba nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa, ngalita kibhonge ade pahe. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Peniya, Nasane ngalongila, “Mwe manahota bhango, manahota nkolongwa, ‘Bho, ntangiche kubhehe Adoniya nabhaha munahota nkolongwa pa chehemo jhino nukutamii kigoda chino chulongoche?’ ” <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Kunhwalo deleno, ahelile na kupiya matambiko ngoo gha ng'ombi na mambelele na matohe gha ng'ombi ghinakuhata na abhalalike yana ino na ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo na mpiya litambiko Abiatale na ngohe bhitenda kulyengana nu kunywelekeya nnonge jhake nu kulonge, “Nname machiko ndii manahota makolongwa Adoniya! <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Nambo ne natumiche bhino na mpiya litambiko jwa Chapanga Sadoke hilu Benaya mwana jwa Yehoyada hilu ntumiche gwino Chelemane bhatulalike jhe. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Bho, gheniya ghoha maghatei mwe manahota bhango, manahota nkolongwa, pangalobholela akatumiche bhino, ghane jwapakutama pa kigoda chu munahota nkolongwa manahota bhango, manahota nkolongwa, unahota nkolongwa pa kubhoka kwino?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Na munahota Daude pajhangwila, “Ungeme Batesheba.” Peniya, Batesheba ngajhenda kujhema nnonge jhake jha munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngalapila kukulonge, “Chakaka ngita Bhambo Chapanga chailama, aghombwii ghome gwango nenga mu mang'ahe ghango ghoha, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ngita hela chinapila kwino nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, kulonge, Mwana gwino Chelemane nabhaha munahota nkolongwa, na chehemo jhango na jwenie natama pikigoda chango chu unahota nkolongwa badala jhango.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Bhahe, Batesheba ngalita kwaichima, nukulonge, “Manahota bhango, manahota nkolongwa, Daude alame machiko ndii!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngalonge, “Ungemele mpiya litambiko Sadoke, nnondole Nasane na Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada.” Na bheniya ngabhajhingila kwa munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Na munahota nkolongwa ngabhalobholila bheniya, Munhobhokeye mwanango Chelemane muliponda lyango, muntolangane jwenio pamonga na akatumiche bha munahota nkolongwa, mumpeleka ade ku yembwe ya Gihone, <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />kwenio mpiya litambiko jwa Chapanga Sadoke na nnondole Nasane bhamiminile mahuta kupala abhaha munahota nkolongwa jwa Ichilahele, kubhoke peniya bhahona mapenenga nu kulonge, “Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane alama machiko ndii! <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Peniya nanhobhoka pamonga na jwenie, na jwenio nahika nu kutama pa kigoda chango chu unahota nkolongwa na kulongocha badala jhango. Jwenio ndi jhuninhagwile kubhehe kilongoche jwa Ichilahele nu ku Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Peniya, Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada nganyangwila munahota nkolongwa, “Amina! Bhambo Chapanga jwa manahota bhango, munahota nkolongwa, na alenganikiya gheniya. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Ngita Bhambo Chapanga pakibha na munahota bhango, munahota nkolongwa, helahela abha pamonga na Chelemane, na kuntenda abhaha munahota nkolongwa nkolo kupeta mwenga.”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko Sadoke na nnondole Nasane na Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada pamonga na Akakelete na Akapelete bhibhakibha akalonda bha munahota nkolongwa, ngabhanhobhokeya Chelemane muliponda lya munahota nkolongwa Daude, nu kumpeleka ade ku yembwe ya Gihone. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Peniya, mpiya litambiko Sadoke ngatola linyelo lilibhii na mahuta lyagheghita Chelemane kubhoke mulihema lya Bhambo Chapanga nu kumiminila Chelemane pamuto kupala munahota nkolongwa. Ngabhajhembita mapenenga na bhando bhoha ngabhalonge, “Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane alame machiko ndii!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Bhando bhoha ngabhankengima, bhakahonita itolilo, ngabhahanganila hake, ata kilambo ngikinyung'inyuka kwa malobhe ghabhe.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya pamonga na akaghene bhibhakibha bhalalilkwe peniya ngabhajhoha bhando bheniya njobhelo pibhajhomolila kulyegha. Yoabu pajhoha lilobhe lya lipenenga ngakonya, “Bho, njobhelo yenio kubomane managhake nike?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Kipinde chalongila gheniya, Yonasane mwana gwa mpiya litambiko Abiasale ngajhingila, peniya Adoniya ngalonge, “Mbaha nhwike nhwalo mwe mamundo bha mbone, nhikite kuleta nhwalo gwambone.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Peniya, Yonasane nganyangwila Adoniya, yene jhe, chakaka munahota nkolongwa Daude antangiche Chelemane kubhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Na jwenie munahota nkolongwa ampelike pamonga na mpiya litambiko Sadoke na nnondole Nasane na Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada na akalonda bha munahota nkolongwa na bheniya bhanhobhokiye pa liponda lya munahota nkolongwa, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />na bheniya, mpiya litambiko Sadoke na nnondole Nasane bhamiminile mahuta pamuto Chelemane kubhehe munahota nkolongwa kwenio ku yembwe ya Gihone, kabhele ngabhabhoka peniya kongo bhakahanganila kumwojho, ndi njobhelo yenio imajhoha. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Ngohe, Chelemane atamite pa kigoda cha unahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Helehela akatumiche bha munahota nkolongwa bhahikite kupala kumpe mota munahota gwito Daude, kulonge, Chapanga gwino alitenda liina lya Chelemane limanyikane kupeta lino, na kigoda chake kibhehe na makakala kupeta chino. Na jwenie munahota nkolongwa Daude ngalitita ade pahe na kujhinamila pikindanda chake. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />Na ngajhopa kukulonge, “Tunnombe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, jwantei jhumo jwa kibheluko chango kubhehe munahota nkolongwa chehemo jhango, na ambekiye ughome ade nighaweine ghanga.”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Bhahe, akaghene bhoha Adoniya ngabhajhogwipa hake, nu kupechengana kwa woghohe kila mundo ndela jhake. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Na Adoniya, ngabhila na kiholo hake kunnyoghopa Chelemane, yene ngatili mu lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga na kukamu manyelo gha chehemo yukupiikii matambiko kupala angakomwa jhe. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Mundo jhumo ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane kubhehe Adoniya atilii ku Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga na kwenio akamulile manyelo gha chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko ngalonge, “Pamba nibhoka jhe ade nyohe kubhehe munahota nkolongwa Chelemane alapii kubhehe nangoma jhe.”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngalonge, “Anda nimwene kubhehe jwangamalemwa naninnekekeya. Nambo andanimwene kubhehe jwanganandela ipalwa akomwa.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngabhatumita bhando bhakampiye mu lihema. Na Adoniya ngajhenda nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa, ngajhinima ku ichima. Munahota nkolongwa ngannobholila, “Ajha, nnyende kajhino.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Daude impe malobhe ghukujhomolela Chelemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Daude pabhandikila kujhomwoka, ngankema mwanamundo Chelemane, ngampila malobhe ghu kujhomolela kukulonge, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />Mwanango, ngita chibhii kwa ihumbe yoha kuwegha, machiko ghango ghajhomokile. Mma nganganga nu mangajhoghopa jhe. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Ntende ghoha ghannobholela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kutenda, nkamula mihilo jhake na malaghalikilo ghake ghoha ngita chighajhandikwe mu malaghalikilo gha Mucha, kupala ilebhe inyendela telatela, kokoha kumijhenda na chochoha chimihenga. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Kupala Bhambo Chapanga alenganikiya lilaghano lyake lyalongila kubhehe, anda ibheluko yango naikamula lilaghano lyake nu kundumikii ku kuhobholeka na kwa mwojho ghoha, napelula jhe jhumo pakate jhabhe kulongocha ku Ichilahele ipinde yoha.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />Kupeta gheniya, mmanye helahela ghandendii Yoabo, mwana gwa Seluya, chabhatendii ilongoche ibhele ya akakakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele, Abinele mwana jwa Nele na Amasa mwana gwa Yetele. Ngabhakomita kipinde cha uteeke kupala kulepechela ngita hela kipinde cha ngondo. Ngabhakomita bhando bhanga malemwa, na nenga ngangokolikilwa ku nhwalo gwa itendwa yake yinetii mang'ahe. Ngapakiya myahe mu luhunga na mu kibhuno chake pamonga na mu ilato yake. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Bhahe, mwe ntenda ngita chimibhona mbone, nambo manganneka jhe ahwa kwa uteeke.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />Nambo matendela ghambone yana ya Balezilai, kubhoka ku Gileade na mabheke bhabhehe pakate jha bhala bhibhalye pamecha jhino. Nhwalo bhakatendii ghambone kipinde pinintilita Abosolumo, nhwacha gwino.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Helahela abhii Shimei mwana gwa Gela Mbenjamine kuhumii ku Bahulimu, jwenio nganapanikiya na nganabheka nhwilo panyendita ku Mahanaimo, nambo paika kumbokela palukemba Yoludane, nganinnapanikiya kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, “Naninkoma jhe kupanga.” <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Nambo mwe mangaleka jhe changanhadabula. Mwe mmi na malango, nammanyi lya kuntendela, pamo nu kubhehe aghoime, mangaleka jhe, munkome.<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Daude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Daude ngajhomwika, ngachikwa ku muche ghukemitwa muche gwa Daude. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Daude akibha alongwiche Ichilahele ku kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche, yaka chaba kwenio ku Hebulone na yaka makome matato na tato kwenio ku Yeluchelamo. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Bhahe, Chelemane ngatama pi kigoda chu unahota nkolongwa chahemo jha Daude tatemundo, nu unahota gwake nkolongwa ngukwima.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwe kwa Adoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Bhahe, Adoniya mwana gwa Hagite ngannyendelela Batesheba, majhemundo Chelemane. Batesheba ngankonya, “Bho, nhwika kwa uteeke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Adoniya nganyangwila, “Ena, nihika kwa uteeke. <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ngajhonjeke kulonge ngwete nhwalo ghumo ghukunnobholela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Batesheba ngankonya, “Nhwalo ghane?”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya ngalongela, “Mmanye kubhehe nenga ngamaha munahota nkolongwa, ku Ichilahele jhoha bhando bhoha bhalendila mme munahota nkolongwa. Nambo mihalo ngighalambwika na unahota nkolongwa ngubhila gwa nnongo gwango, ku nhwalo gheniya ndi ghapalita Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Ngohe, ninnyopa kilebhe chimo tu chonde manganganii jhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Batesheba ngankonyita, “Kilebhe ghane?”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Jwenio ngalonge, “Chonde ninnyopa, munnyope munahota nkolongwa Chelemane anyeketele nintole Abishage, kuhumii ku Shuname, abhehe nhwana gwango, nhwalo manye nankanila jhe.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batesheba ngalonge, “Tela, naninnobholela munahota nkolongwa nhwalo gwenio.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Peniya, Batesheba nganyendila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane kupala kulonge nako kunhwalo gwa Adoniya. Munahota nkolongwa ngajhinuka kujhenda kumpokela majhemundo, ngannitilila. Peniya ngatama pikigoda chake chu unahota nkolongwa, ngalaghila kiletwa kigoda chenge cha kinahota nkolongwa atamii majhemundo, jwenio majhe ngatama upande gwake gwalelo gwa munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Batesheba ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane, “Mii nunhwalo gwandina, ninnyopa mangangananii jhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Munahota nkolongwa ngalonge, “Mwe nnongelela nhwalo gwino majhe bhango, ninkanakila jhe.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Majhe jhola ngalongila, “Munnyeketele nhwacha gwino Adoniya antolele Abishage, jhuku Shuname.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngankonya majhemundo, “Bho, nhwalo ghane mipala nimpe Abishage? Yene, mihoto kunnyope ata unahota nkolongwa gwango ku nhwalo gwake! Kuchocha gheya mmanye kubhehe jwenie ndi nhwacha gwango. Na nkomboka kubhehe mpiya litambiko Abiasale na kilongoche nkolo jwa akakomana ngondo Yoabo mwana gwa Seluya, bhabhii upande gwake!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngalapila ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, kulonge, “Chapanga angoma, anda naninkoma jhe Adoniya kwa kunyopa kilebhe chenje! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Ngohe bhahe, ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, jwamekite nukundenda nganganga mu unahota nkolongwa gwa tategwango Daude na jwalenganikiye malaghano ghake, ngambila unahota nkolongwa nenga pamonga na ibhelukwa yango, chakaka nilapii deleno Adoniya nakomwa!”<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngannaghila Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, na jwenio nganyendelila Adoniya, ngambulita ade kunkoma.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwa Yoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngannobholila mpiya litambiko Abiasale, “Mmoke nnyende kunng'onda gwino, kwenio ku Anasosi, mwe mipalwa nkomwa! Nambo ngohe, naninkoma jhe, nhwalo nng'eghita lichanduko li lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga pumukibha na tate gwango Daude, na kabhele nng'aitwa pamonga na jwenio.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Yene munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngammengita Abiasale angabhe jhe mpiya litambiko jwa Bhambo Chapanga, yene ngalilenganila lilobhe lya longila Bhambo Chapanga kwenio ku Shilo, ku nhwalo gwa Ele nu lukolo lwake.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu pajhoha nhwalo gwenio, ngatilila mu lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga nu kukamulila manyelo gha mecha jha maghanga jhukupiikiya litambiko, nhwalo akibha maghumba nde na Adoniya nambo akankengime jhe Abusolamo. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pajhoha kubhehe Yoabo abhii mu lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga na akamulii manyelo gha mecha jha maghanga jhukupiikiya litambiko, ngantuma Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, ngannobholila, “Nnyende makankome.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Yene, Benaya ngajhingii mu Lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngannobholila Yoabo, “Munahota nkolongwa alaghii mpite panja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Yoabo ngajhangwila, “Ne nipita jhe, niwelela mombonemone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya ngajhenda ku munahota nkolongwa nu kunnobholela ghalongii Yoabo.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngalonge, Ntende ngita chalongii, munkome nu kunchika. Yene nenga na ibhelukwa henge yoha ya Daude, natukokolekelwa jhe ku itendwa ya Yoabo ya kwakoma bhando bhanga malemwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Bhambo Chapanga nanhadabula Yoabo kukoma kwateile changa manya tate gwango Daude. Yoabo akakomite bhando bhabhele bhangamalemwa, Abinele mwana gwa Nele kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo jwa Akaichilahele, na Amasa mwana gwa Yetele, kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo jwa Yuda, bhabhele bheniya bhakibha bhambone na bhibhajheketelwa nnonge jha Chapanga kuliku jwenie. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Malemwa gha kukoma kwenio lubhaha panane jha Yoabo na ibhelukwa yake machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Nambo kwa Daude na ibhelukwa yake na bhando bha munyumba jhake na kigoda chake cha unahota nkolongwa nakubhabhaha na uteeke gwa machiko ghoha kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Yene, Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada ngajhenda mu lihema lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngankoma Yoabo, na ngabhanchika ku nyumba jhake, jhikibha kwenio kunjenga. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Munahota nkolongwa ngammeka Benaya mwana jwa Yehoyada kubhehe kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo chehemo jha Yoabo, na Sadoke ngabhila mpiya litambiko chehemo jha Abiasale.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwe kwa Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngalaghila Shimei akemwe, ngannobholila, “Mikichenge nyumba pamba pa Yeluchalemo, ntama pamba na mangajhenda jhe chehemo jhojhoha jhela. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Nhwalo lichiko limpa kubhoka nu kujhomboka kipela Kidulone, chakaka ninnobholela nantendakuwegha, na mikibheke uloche kwa kuhwe kwino mabhene.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei ngajhangwila, “Chakaka munahota nkolongwa, nandenda ngita chunnongile.” Bhahe, ngatamita ku Yeluchalemo machiko twe.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Nambo kubhoke pa yaka itato, akabhanda bhake bhabhele ngabhanyogholwika, ngabhajhenda kwa Akishe mwana gwa Maaka, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Gate. Shimei pajhoha nhwalo gwenio kubhehe akabhanda bhabhii ku Gate, <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />ngahobheke liponda lyake, ngajhenda kwenio kwapalaha akabhanda bhake, ku munahota Akishe. Yene ngaika ngabhapata, na kwabhujhicha kajhake. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pajhoha nhwalo gwenio kubhehe Shimei abhokite ku Yeluchalemo, na kujhenda ku Gate nu kubhujha, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />ngankema Shimei nu kunnobholela, Bho, nakannobholii jhe nnapile ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe mibhoka jhe ku Yeluchalemo? Bho, nanenga nganimpwatalila kubhehe anda nnyighite kujhenda panja mpakuwegha? Namwenga ngannyeketila, ngunongila, nanighakamula malobhe ghino. <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Kunhwalo ghane ntwekwii kilapo chino kwa Bhambo Chapanga na nnyokanikii jhe mihilo jhininnobholile? <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Munahota nkolongwa ngajhendilila kunnobholela Shimei, “Umanye hotuhotu mabhoho ghumuntendii tate gwango Daude, na ngohe ku nhwalo gwa gheniya, Bhambo Chapanga nanhadabula. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Nambo nenga nambela mota, na kigoda chu unahota nkolongwa cha Daude nakibha nganganga nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngannaghila Benaya mwana gwa Yehoyada, na jwenio ngabhoka, ngambula Shimei nu kunkoma. Yene unahota nkolongwa gwa Chelemane ngukwima.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Chelemane ijhopa malango</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2 Ngongu 1:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Chelemane ngalombina na Falao munahota nkolongwa jwaku Michile, kukuntolela kamwale jwa Falao. Nganneta bite Falao ku muche gwa Daude, ade pajhomwila kuchenga nyumba jhake jhu unahota nkolongwa jwenie, na nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, pamonga na kuchenga lipamanda kutindii muche gwa ku Yeluchalemo. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Ade kuhiki kipinde chenie bhando bhakibha bhamela bhipiya matambiko ghukukomelekelwa kuitombe, ku nhwalo nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga ikibha jhammela ichengitwe ndeka, <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Chelemane ngampaila Bhambo Chapanga, kukukengama malaghalikilo ghapeilwa na Daude, tatemundo, ata yene akibha apihita matambiko ghukukomelekelwa na kututukiya ubane muitombe.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Lichiko limo, Chelemane ngajhenda kupiya litambiko kwenio ku Gibeone, nhwalo pakibha chehemo jhimanyikine hake pa kunnyinamila Chapanga. Chelemane Akayobhalile kupiya matambiko maelufo ghu kutiniya chehemo jhu kupiikiya matambiko gheniya. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Kwenio ku Gideone, Bhambo Chapanga ngampitila mu maloto Chelemane kilo ngannobholila, “Nnyopa chochoha chimipala nanimpela.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Chelemane ngajhangwila, “Nnangiye upalo gwangokoma kwa ntumiche gwino Daude tate gwango. Ku nhwalo akibha jhunakuhobholeka kwino na jhuna kujheketelwa na jhuna mwojho gwa mbone, namwe nnyendilii munnyonjekii umbone nkolongwa, kukumpe mwana jwa kutama pa kigoda chake chu unahota nkolongwa ngita chibhii ngohe. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, umekite natumiche bhino me munahota nkolongwa chehemo jha tate gwango Daude, nambo nenga namwana jwandina na nimanyii jhe kulongocha. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Pamba nitama pakate jha bhando twe bhimahagwii mabhene, bheniya ndi bhamahele hake, atabhibhalangika jhe ku nhwalo gwa ghukujholoka kwabhe. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Yene, chonde ninnyopa umbe nenga natumiche gwino malango ghukumanya pakate jha ghambone na ghanganandela, kupala nhoto kwalongocha bhando bhino kwa umbone, nhwalo nanhotola bhole kwalongocha bhando twe ngita bhamba?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Lujhopo lwenio lwa Chelemane lwakanhalalii hake Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Chapanga ngannobholila, “Ku nhwalo nnyopite kilebhe chenie, mikijhopii jhe mabhene ghome ndii amu ilebhe mbwe, hilu nnyopite jhe akamakoko bhino bhakomwe, nambo nnyopite malango nu umanye gwa kutenda changalolekeya kumiho, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />ngohe, nanenganikiya chenie chunnyopite. Bhahe, nanimpela malango na uhotolo gwa kubangatuka, yenio anapitii jhe mundo jhojhoha pannema pano ngita mwenga, hilu napitila jhe mundo jhonge jhojhoha. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Helahela, nanimpela ghange ghunnyopite jhe, nanimpela ilebhe mbwe na ichima, kupeta akanahota akakolongwa bhange bhobhoha bhala. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kabhele anda nantembekeya nu kwikamula mihilo jhango na ngita chateila tate gwino Daude, peniya, nanimpela ghome gwa machiko twe.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Chelemane pajhimwika, ngamanya kubhehe Chapanga alongile nako mumaloto. Ngabhujha ku Yeluchalemo, ngajhema nnonge jha Lichanduko lya lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngapiya litambiko lya kukomelekelwa na lya uteeke. Peniya ngabhatendela unyagho akatumiche bhake bhoha.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chelemane ihadabu kwa malango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Lichiko limo, akakeghe bhabhele akangongola, ngabhajhenda ku munahota nkolongwa Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Jhumo ngalonge, “Mwe manahota makolongwa,” ne na mwikeghe ojho tutama nyumba jhimo, nenga ngambapita mwana munalome kipinde ojho abhii peniya. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Machiko matato nnonge, ojho ngapapa mwana munalome. Mwenio akibha jhe mundo jhonge, nambo twe tu tabhele. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Nambo lichiko limo, kilo mwana gwake ngajhomoka nhwalo akatehi kung'olokela. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Pang'ang'anwika kilo, ngantola mwana jwanenga kipinde nenga mmi lughono likitii, ngang'oneka pikindanda chake. Peniya, ngatola ntuhe gwa mwana gwake ngammeka pakindanda chanenga. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Pinyimwika lukela nu kupala kumpe mwanango libhele ajhonge, ngannimmona ajhomwike. Paninningukiya hake, ngahumbwila kubhehe akibha mwanango jhe.<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Nambo mwikeghe jhonge jhola ngalonge, “Uwange! Mwana jwabhii ghome ndi jwango na mwana jwajhomwike ndi jwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Na mwikeghe jwatumbwila kulonge jhola, “Uwange! Mwana gwino ndi jwajhomwike, na jwango ndi jwabhii ghome!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Yene ndi chibhajhendilila kutaungana nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngalonge, “Mabhoha milonge mwana gwango ndi jwabhii ghome na jhola jwajhomwike ndi jwino.” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngannobholila ntumiche gwake, “Netela upanga!” Na bhene ngabhannetila. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Munahota nkolongwa ngalongila, “Munhwekete mwana jwabhii ghome ipande ibhele, mumpela jhumo kipande chimo na jhonge kipande chenge.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mwikeghe jwakibha majhe jwa mwana jwenio jwabhii ghome, ngabhila na kiya, ngalonge, “Nai jhe, manganhanjulana jhe mwana mbaha mumpela ojho antole, kongo abhii ghome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Nambo mwikeghe jhonge jhola ngalongila, “Nai jhe! Mbaha mwana jwenio munkenjulane ipande ibhele. Angabhehe jhe mwana jwango hilu jwake.”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa ngalonge, “Mangankoma jhe mwana! Mumpela mwikeghe jhu kutumbula antole, nhwalo chakaka jwenio ndi majhe mundo.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Bhando bhoha ku Ichilahele pibhajhohina panane jha luhadabulo lwapihita munahota nkolongwa, ngabhannyogwipa, nhwalo ngabhamanya kubhehe akibha na malango gha Chapanga ghighannongwiya kwahadabula bhando changalolekeya kumiho.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Akatumiche bha Chelemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Bhahe, Chelemane akibha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele kwoha, <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />na bhamba ndi ilongoche bhibhakibha, mu ulongoche gwake, Azaliya mwana jwa Sadoke, akibha mpiya litambiko.<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Eliholefo na Ahiya yana ya Shausha, bhakibha bhu kujhandika, na Yehoshafate mwana jwa Ahilude, akibha jhukujhandika mihalo jhalaghila munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya, mwana jwa Yehoyada, akibha kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo. Sadoke na Abiasale, bhakibha akapiya matambiko.<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azaliya, mwana jwa Nasane, akibha nnyemelela nkolongwa jwa ilongoche bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, mpiya litambiko Zabude mwana jwa Nasane, akibha nkoche jwa munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishale akibha ajhemelila nyumba jha munahota nkolongwa na Adonilamo mwana jwa Abuda, akibha kilongoche jwa mahengo ghukuchokolekeya.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Chelemane ngabhahagwila akajhemelela bha kome na bhabhele bha miche jhuku Ichilahele. Bheniya ngabhapeilwa lihengo lya kupalaha chakulya ku nhwalo gwa munahota nkolongwa na bhando bha panyumba jhake, kila mundo pakate jhabhe ngaletita chakulya kuhumii ku wilaya jhake mwehe ghumo kila chaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Ghanga ndi maina gha ilongoche bha wilaya yenio, mwana jwa Hule ngajhema chehemo jhi itombe ya Efulahimo,<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />na mwana jwa Dekele ajhemelila miche jha Makai na Shaalibimo na Bete Shemeshe na Elone Betianane. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />na mwana jwa Hesede ajhemelila miche jha Alubote helahela ajhemelila ku gulio na wilaya jhoha jha Hefele.<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Na mwana jwa Abinadabo nhwana mundo Tafate, bite Chelemane, ngalongwicha muche gwa Nafatedole na chehemo jhake.<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana, mwana jwa Ahilude, ngajhemelila miche jha Taanake pamonga na Megido na chehemo jhoha jha Bete Sheane jhibhii pahina na muche gwa Zalete, kuupande ghu kuchine mwa muche gwa Yezeleele ade kumuche gwa Abele mehola na muche gwa Yokimeamo.<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />na mwana jwa Gebele, ngajhemelela muche gwa Lamote Gileade pamonga na chenda iku Gileade ikibha pahe jha Yaile, mwana jwa Manache, helahela ngajhemelila chenda ya Aligobo ibhii ku chehemo jha Bashane, na miche jhake makome chita, ibhakatindiki mapamanda nu kubhekwa miniko jha shaba.<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabo, mwana jwa Ido, akibha ijhemelela chehemo jha Mahanaimo.<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaase, unganamundo Basemate, bite Chelemane, ngajhemelela chehemo jha Nafutale.<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana, mwana jwa Hushai, ngajhemelela chehemo jha Ashele nuku Bealote.<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafate mwana jwa Palua, ngajhemelela chehemo jha Ichakale.<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei, mwana jwa Ela, akibha ijhemelela chehemo jha Benjamine.<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Gebele, mwana jwa Ule, ajhemelela chehemo jha Gileade, kilambo chikilongwichwa na Sihone munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaamole, na Ogu munahota nkolongwa jwa Bashane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 4:19">Na jwenie akibha nnyemelela jwa kanjika jwa chehemo jhenio jhoha.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongoche gwa Chelemane utenda kukonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Bhando bhuku Yuda na bhuku Ichilahele bhakibha twe ngita ncheke ghukumbwane, bhakibha na yakulya mbwe, ngabhalila nukunywelekeya na kuhanganila. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngalongwicha inahota ikolongwa yoha, kutumbulila lukemba Eufulate na kilambo choha cha Akafilichite ade kumipaka jha Michile. Ilambo yenio ngabhantumikila nu kulepa kode kipinde choha cha ghome gwake.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Chakulya chikipalitwa panyumba jha Chelemane ku lichiko limo, ukibha ukobha ghunakutema madebe miya itato na chitine, na ukobha gwangatema madebe miya chaba na ichiline, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />ng'ombi kome yihatite na ng'ombi makome mabhele yukuluchila mukibhajha na mambelele na mbuhe miya jhimo pamonga na lijhate na oloko na ngoko inakuhata.<verse eid="1KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Nhwalo Chelemane akalongichwe ilambo yoha upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mwa lukemba Eufulate, kuhumii ku Tifisa ade ku Gacha, najwenio ngabhila na uteeke pande yoha. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Machiko ghoha ghu ulongoche gwa Chelemane, bhando bhuku Yuda na bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatamita njelembo, kuhumii ku Dane ade ku Belesheba, kila mundo ngahotwila kuhenga mahengo mu mighonda jhake jha mikongo jha michabibo na mikongo jha mitine.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Chelemane akibha na ichimba elufo alobaine na mutuka yukuhutwa na falache, na akakomana ngondo bhibhahobhokee falache elufo kome ni ibhele. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Akajhemelela bhake kome nibhabhele, kila jhumo pakate jhabhe kwa mwehe gwapangilwe kwa chaka, apelika chakulya kunhwalo gwa munahota nkolongwa na bhando bhoha bhibhatama pa muche gwenio. Na ngabhaleta ilebhe yoha yapalita Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Helahela akajhemelela bheniya bhapelika chayile na manyahe ghukulichikii falache na inyama ibhutuka hake.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Chapanga ngampila Chelemane malango ghamahele na uhotolo nkolongwa ghukubangatuka, umanyi gwake ukibha nkolongwa ngita ncheke gwa kumbwane. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Chelemane akibha na malango hake kupeta malango gha bhando bhoha bha upandi ghulipitii lyobha na ngolongwa kupeta malango gha bhando bhuku Michile. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Ngabhapeta bhando bhoha kwa malango, nganhuotwila Esane, jwahumii ku Esila, akibha na malango kupeta Hemane na Kalikole na Dalida, yana ya Mahole, chipwa jhake ngijhokanika mu ilambo yoha ya pahina. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Ngajhandika Homo elufo itato pamonga na mihambo elufo jhimo na nhwano. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Ngalongela ughome gwa mikongo, na kumanyikana kwa nkongo gwa mweleze ghubhii ku Lebanone na nkongo gwa mwisopo ghulandala mu mapamanda na ngalongila mihalo jhi inyama yukumanyahe pamonga na ijhune ikukoleka na ikwabha pamonga na homba yu mumache. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Bhando kuhumii mu ilambo yoha na akanahota akakolongwa bhoha pibhajhohina nhwalo gwa malango ghake, ngabhaika kunnyokanikiya.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Chelemane ikilenganikiya kuchenga Nyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Ngongu 2:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Hilamo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Tilo jwakibha nkochemundo munahota nkolongwa Daude, pajhoha kubhehe Chelemane bhamminile mahuta abhehe munahota nkolongwa chehemo jha tatemundo Daude, ngabhatuma akatumiche bhake kwajwenio. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Bhahe, Chelemane ngabhujhicha malobhe kwa munahota nkolongwa Hilamo kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Umanye kubhehe tate gwango Daude akanchengii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwake nyumba jhukunnyinamila, nhwalo akibha na ngondo ndiii kubhoke mu ilambo yoha itindila ade Bhambo Chapanga pampila kwahotola.” <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Nambo ngohe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango ambii uteeke pandi yoha mu ilambo. Ngohe abhii jhe likoko na kabhele kibhii jhe kilebhe changanandela. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito ngalaghina na tategwango kulonge, “Mwana gwino jwapa kubhehe munahota nkolongwa kubhoke kwino mwenga, aichenga Nyumba jhu kunyinamila nenga. Ku nhwalo gwenio mbakunchenge Nyumba jha kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga! <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Bhahe, malaghalikiye bhando bhino bhajhende ku Lebanone bhakapengulile heke ya mieleze. Bhando bhango nabhalombana na bhando bhino mu lihengo lyenie, nanenga nanalepa akatumiche bhino ngita chibhapala kulonge. Nhwalo tikweti jhe mundo jhojhoha jwahoto kupengu mikongo ngita akatumiche bhino bhuku Sidone.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Kipinde Hilamo pajhohina nhwalo gwenio ngahanginala hake kumwojho, ngalonge, “Deleno alombwe Bhambo Chapanga, kukumpe Daude mwana jhuna malango alongoche kilambo chenje kikolongwa.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Hilamo ngammujhichila Chelemane malobhe ghanga, “Nyohine malobhe ghino, nanenga nandenda ngita chimipala ku nhwalo gwa mbau ya mieleze na yi mibeloshe. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Bhando bhango nabhabhilimbiya magogo kubhoke ku Lebanone ade ku mbwane, napeniya bhitabha mihigho kupala ghajhebhela panane jha mache ade chehemo jhimpakupokela. Peniya bhando bhango nabhakwilughana na bhando bhino bhitola. Nambo chimipalwa mwenga kwape chakulya bhando bhango.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Yene Hilamo ngampila Chelemane magogo ghoha imieleze na ya mibeloshe yaipalita, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Chelemane kila chaka ngampila Hilamo ngano madebe lake ibhele na alobaine na mahuta gha mbone gha micheitune madebe miya ibhele kila chaka, kupala ibhaha yakulya ya bhando bhibhabhii munyumba jhake.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Yene Bhambo Chapanga ngampila Chelemane malango ngita chalongila. Chelemane na Hilamo, ngabhateila majhetelano ghu kubhe teeke panakate jhi ilambo yabhe.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngakonganicha bhando elufo chelachine kubhoke kila chehemo kukilambo cha Ichilahele, kupala kuhenga mahengo gha kwachokolekeya, <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />ngabhapelika ku Lebanone kwa chamo jha bhando elufo kome kwa mwehe. Yene ngabhatama ku Lebanone kwa mwehe ghumo na myehe mibhele ukajha, Adonilamo ndi jwakibha kilongoche jwa mahengo gheniya. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Chelemane akibha helahela akaghegha mihigho elufo chabine, na akakajhuu maghanga elufo chemanine kwenio kuitombe, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />pamonga na akajhemelela elufo itato na miya itato bhibhajhemelila lihengo lyenie, na akahenga mahengo bhoha. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Kwa malaghalikilo jha munahota nkolongwa, ngabhahembula maghanga makolongwa na ghambone, kupala ghabhachwa ku nhwalo gwa kuchenge nchinge gwa nyumba. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Bhahe, yene ndi mapunde kuchenga bha Chelemane na Hilamo na bhando bhi kilambo cha Gebale chibhalenganikiya maghanga na mbau yu kuchengela Nyumba jhenio jha Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Chelemane ichenga Nyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Chelemane ngatumbu kuchenga Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga mu chaka cha miya ncheche na chemanine, kubhoke pa Akaichilahele kuhama ku Michile. Chenio kikibha chaka cha ncheche chu ulongoche gwa Chelemane kwa Akaichilahele, ku mwehe gwa zifo, yane mwehe ghu ubhele. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Nyumba jhenie munahota nkolongwa Chelemane nganchenge Bhambo Chapanga ikibha kutandamala kwake mita makome mabhele na chaba, kupanuka kwake meta ticha na ukola kujhenda kunane meta kome na tato na nucho. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Udamo gwa palonge ukibha ujhanuko gwake mita ncheche na nucho kubhoke upande ghumo gwa nyumba ade upande ghonge. Nu utandamaho gwake nnonge jha Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga ukibha meta ticha. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Ngabheka madilicha nyumba jhenio, kila lidilicha likibha lijhanuka kwa nkate na likombao kwa panja. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Helahela ngajhemeka heke kutindila, kupala kujheghemekela lipamanda kwa panja, ngabhatendeke yumba ya mupele kila upande. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Chumba cha pahe kikibha na ujhanuko gwa meta ibhele na chentimeta ichiline nu nhwano, na chumba chubhele kuhobhoka kunane kikibha na ujhanuko gwa meta ibhele na chentimeta chabine nu nhwano, na chumba cha panane hake, kikibha na ujhanuko gwa meta itato. Hyumba ya nyumba jhenio ilekenila ku ujhanuko, nhwalo Chelemane akapongwiche kandina lipamanda lya panja kutindii nyumba, kupala nng'omba ikamulila nyumba yangajheghemeke jhe lipamanda.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Kipinde Nyumba ikachengwa, pakajhokanikike jhe njobhelo ya nyundo hilu kilebhe chochoha cha choma pa chehemo jhukuchenga, nhwalo ikachengwitwe kwa maghanga ghighakibha ghabhachitwe na ghighalenganikilwe kwenio kughatoilwa.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Nnyango ghukujhingilila mu chumba cha pahe ukibha upandi gwa kuchine mwa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. Nkate, mukibha na ngache jhukukwelela kujhenda pa chumbe chu kutumbula na chapakate na chu utato. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Yene Chelemane ngaichenga nyumba, ngajhomolela. Kipaghalo cha Nyumba ngatengenicha kwa bolite na mbau ya mieleze. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Kulitindii lipamanda lya panja lya nyumba jhenio, ngachenga hyumba ina kutandamala kujhenda kunane meta ibhele na lobo kila chumba, na yenie ikibha ilombine na nyumba jha Chapanga kwa bolite ya mieleze.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chelemane, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Ku nhwalo gwa nyumba jhenio jhimichenga, anda mikamwile mihilo jhango jhoha na malaghalikilo ghango, nanenganikiya ghoha ghaninaghila tategwino Daude. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Ne nitama panakate jha bhando bhango aka Ichilahele, hilu ninnekangana ng'o.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Bhahe, Chelemane ngachenga Nyumba jha Chapanga nukujhomolela.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe ya nkate ya munyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:8-14">2 Ngongu 3:8-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Upande gwa nkate gwa lipamanda lya nyumba ngayekelela kwa mbau ya mieleze, kubhoka pa chakapo jha Nyumba jha Chapanga ade pa kipaghalo chake, na pa chakapo ngatandika mbau ya mibeloshe. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Nkate jha nyumba kikibha chumbe cha Chehemo jha nyahinyahi Hake. Kikibha kichengwitwe kwa mbau ya mieleze kubhoke pa chakapo ade padale kupala abhaghanicha chehemo jha nyahinyahi Hake, kutandamala kwake kukibha meta ticha. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Chumbe cha nnonge jha Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake, kikibha na utandamaho gwake meta kome na nane. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Mbau ya imieleze ibhekitwa mu mapamanda gha Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga jhenie kwa nkate ikalembekilwe kwa nnandanikilo gwa maboga na malobha ghighatolwike. Kila chehemo ikayekelilwe kwa mbau ya mieleze, hilu likibha jhe lighanga lilibhonikina mu lipamanda.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Chehemo jha nkate hake mu Nyumba jhenie jha Chapanga, Chelemane ngatendekeya chumbe cha kanjika ku nhwalo gwa kubheke Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Chumbe chenie kikibha kutandamala kujhenda kunane meta ticha, ujhanuko gwake meta ticha na ukola kwake meta ticha, chumbe chenie ngalembelekeya kwa chaabo jhambone. Helahela ngatendeke chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko kwa mbau yi mieleze. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Chelemane ngayekelela kwa chaabo jhambone chehemo jhenio jha nkate jha chumbi chenio na ngatanditiya mikufo jha chaabo chehemo jha nkate kubhoke upande ghumo ade ghonge, ngalembelikiya kwa chaabo. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Nyumba jhoha kwa nkate ikayekalilwe kwa chaabo, helahela ngayekelila mecha jhoha jhukututukiya ubane jhibhii nkate jha chumbi chenio kwa chaabo.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Ngatenganicha ihumbe ibhele ina mapapanilo ikemwa makelube kwa mbau ya micheitune, kila kihumbe chimo kikibha na utandamaho kujhenda kunane mita ncheche na nucho, ngaibhekita mu chumbi chenio cha nkate. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kila lipapanilo kutandamala kwake likibha mita ibhele na nucho, yene kutandamala kubhoke upandi gwa lipapanilo limo ade upande ghonge likibha na mita nhwano ihumbe yoha ibhele ikibha na ipemo inakulandana na utandamaho ghulandana. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Likelube lenge likibha nu kutandamala kwa mita nhwano, makelube ghoha mabhele ghakibha na ipemo inakulandana nu kutandamala kwake. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Utandamaho gwa likelube limo ukibha mita nhwano, helahela utandamaho gwa likelube lenge lela ukibha ghogholaghola. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Makelube ghoha ngaghabhekwa mu chumbe cha nkate Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake, kongo mapapanilo ghabhe mabhele ghaatambulilwe, lipapanilo lya jhumo ngilipapiha lipamanda limo na lipapanilo lya jhonge ngilipapiha lipamanda lenge, na kongo mapapanilo ghange ghala ngaghakobhikina panakate jha chumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Na makelube gheniya ngaghayekelilwa kwa chaabo.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Munane mwa mapamanda gha nkate na panja, ngilembelekilwa kwa micholu jha makelube ghina mapapanilo na mikongo jha mitende na micholu ya malobha ghighatolwike. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Heleheela ngayekelila chakapo yoha ya hyumba ya panja na nkate kwa chaabo.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Pannyango ghukujhingilii mu chumbi cha nkate hake ngatendeke milyango jha mbau ya micheitune. Milyango jhenie ikibha na ikolamino na mafelemo ibhonikina ibhii na pandi nhwano. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Ku milyango mibhele jhenio jhi micheitune, ngabhacha ihumbe ina mapapanilo, na mitende na malobha ghighatolwike, ngaiyekelila mbao yenio na micholo jhenio kwa chaabo jha mbone. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Helahela ngatengenicha lifelemo lilibhii telatela mapana nu kutandamala ku nhwalo gwa litangala lya kujhingiliii paudamo kwa mu ya micheitune, <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />iyekelelo yake ibhele ya mbau yi mibeloshe na kila kiyekelelo chikihoto kukungutala. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Panane jha iyekelelo ya milango jhenie, ngabhacha picha ya ihumbe ina mapapanilo, mitende na malobha ghighatolwike, ngayekelila micholo jhenio kwa chaabo.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Kabhele ngachenga lwane lwa nkate kwa chapo itato ya maghanga ghighabhachitwe na chapo jhimo jha bolite jha mikongo jha mieleze jhilembelekilwe.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Nchinge gwa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga nguchengitwa mu mwehe gwa Zivu, yane mwehe ghu nhwano, mu chaka cha ncheche chu ulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Na mumwehe gwa Bule, yane mwehe gwa nane, mu chaka cha kome na jhimo chu ulongoche gwa Chelemane, kuchenga kwa Nyumba ngukujhomokila, na lihengo lyenio ngilijhomokila ngita hela Chelemane chalaghilwa. Bhahe, Chelemane ngaichenga Nyumba jhenio ku kipende cha yaka chaba.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Nyumba jha munahota nkolongwa Chelemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Chelemane ngachenga nyumba jha kinahota nkolongwa, jhenio kwa yaka kome na itato ade pijhomokila. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Peniya, ngachenga nyumba jha kinahota nkolongwa jhikemitwa Nyumba jha Litogholo jha Lebanone. Kutandamala kwake kukibha mita makome ncheche nu nucho, kujhanuka kwake mita makome mabhele ni ibhele nucho ukola kujhenda kunane mita kome na tato na lobo. Ikibha ichengitwe michitale ncheche panane jha heke imieleze, heke yenie ikamulila bolite ya mieleze upande ghu kunane. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Kila nchitale ukibha na heke kome nu nhwano, jumula yoha ikibha heke makome ncheche nu nhwano. Yumbe ichengitwe panane jha heke yenie, ngaibheke dale jhi mieleze. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Kukibha na michitale mitato jha madilicha ghighalolekeyana. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Milyango jhoha na madilicha ghakibha na mafelemo telatela kila upande, na michitale mitato ya madilicha mu kila lipamanda ghighalolekeyana pena nnonge.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Ngachenga udamo gwa heke, kutandamala kwake kukibha mita makome mabhele niibhele na lobo, nu kujhanuka kwake mita kome na tato na nucho. Nnonge jha udamo gwenio kukibha na bwalo, na nnonge jha chebule kukibha na heke, na nnonge jha heke ngakipitii kipaghalo kichokombe.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Helahela ngachenga chumbe chukubhekeya Kigoda chu ulongoche mwenio ahadabulila mihalo jha bhando. Chenio kikemitwa Chumbe chu Kuhadabulila. Kikibha kilembelekilwe kwa mbau ya mieleze kuhumii pahe ade kudale.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Nyumba jhake jhukutama jwene, jhikibha kuyeto jha Chumbe chu Kuhadabulila, ikibha ichengitwe ngita henge. Helahela Chelemane ngachenga nyumba jhiwanana ngita udamo gwenio gwa bite Falao, nhwanamundo.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Majhumba gheniya ghoha ghakachengitwe kwa maghanga gha bei kutumbulii nchinge ade kunane, maghanga gheniya ghakibha ghabhachitwe ku kipemo chikipalwa, nu kuheketwa kwa nchumeno upande gwa nkate na panja. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Michinge jha Nyumba yenio ikibha ya maghanga gha bei ngolongwa ghina kutandamala kwa mita itato na nucho, na kujhanuka kwake mita ncheche na nucho. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Chehemo jhu kunane jhikachengitwe kwa maghanga ghange ghambone hake, ghighabhachitwe ku kipemo chikipalwa, na kwa mbau ya mieleze. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Udamo ghola nkolongwa lwa nyumba jha munahota nkolongwa, lukatindii mapamanda michitale mitato jha maghanga ghighabhachwitwe na nchitele ghumo gwa bolite ya mieleze jhilembwitwe, ngita chiubhii udamo gwa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga na udamo gwake.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengo gha Hilamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:13-14">2 Ngongu 2:13-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngankema Hilamo kubhoke ku Tilo. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Hilamo akibha mwana jwa nawela jwa likabila lya Nafutale, na tatemundo akibha nnhyana yoma na atamita ku kilambo chuku Tilo. Hilamo akibha na malango hake nu umanye, na punde jwambone jhu lihengo lyolyoha lya shaba. Bhahe, ngaika ku munahota nkolongwa Chelemane, ngantende lihengo lyake lyoha.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heke ibhele ya shaba ya Nyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Ngongu 3:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hilamo ngatendekeya heke ibhele ya shaba, kila luheke lukibha kutandamala kwake mita ticha na mita chita kutindii kwake. Nu kubheka panyango gwa Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Kunane jhake ngatengenicha ngita hingo ibhele ya shaba, kila hingo ikibha na mita ibhele na lobo, ngabheka panane jha heke yenie. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Peniya ngatendekiya, lwaho ibhele ku mikupo jha chaba shaba, ngabheka panane jha hingo mu kila heke yenie. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Kabhele, ngatendekeya makomamanga, ngapanga michitale mibhele kutindii hingo panane jha kila heke.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Hingo yenio ikibha panane jha heke nnonge jha udamo, ikalembelekilwe kukulandanikiya kwa malobha ghi ing'ala, kukola kwake kukibha mita jhimo na chentimita chabine nu nhwano. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Na hingo ikibha panane jha heke ibhele yenie, helahela ikibha panane jha chehemo jhibhii ngita bakule jhipitii panja pahina na lwaho. Pakibha na makomamanga miya ibhele kila michitale mibhele kutindii kila hingo.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hilamo ngaibheka heke yenie pa udamo gwa nyumba jha Chapanga, luheke lwajhemike upandi gwa kuchine ngalukema Yakine na upandi gwa kachikachine ngalukema Boache. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Kunane jha heke yenie ngilembelikilwa ku kulandana na malobha gha yungeyunge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:22">Yene, lihengo li kutengenecha heke ngilijhomokila.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kihulo kikolongwa cha shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Ngongu 4:2-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Hilamo ngatengenicha kihulo kikolongwa lilikemitwa Mbwane jha choma. Likibha kujhanuka kwake mita ncheche na nucho kubhoke upande ghumo ade ghonge upande, kunyolika kwake mita ibhele na lobo na kulitindila mita kome na tato na nucho. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Pahe pulibhujhile kutindii kihulo chenio, kukibha na michitale mibhele ya itamilo yake ibhele shaba ibhii ngita mongo, kila chimo kikibha mita kome ni itato na nucho. Itamilo yenio ikatengenichwe kipinde cheche pilitengenicha kihulo chenio. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Kihulo chenio kikibha kibhekitwe panane jha inyagho ya makambako kome na mabhele gha ng'ombi ghighalolikiya panja, matato ghalolita upandi gwa kachikachine na matato upandi ghulitipikii lyobha na matato upandi gwa kuchine na ghange matato upandi ghulihumii lyobha. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Kukenda kwake kukibha chentimita chaba na nucho, upendo gwake ulandina na mbindo ya kikombe nu kubhonekana ngita lilobha lya yungeyunge. Kihulo ngakihoto kutwele mache kuhikii lita elufo makome ncheche.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itamilo ya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Helahela Hilamo ngatendekeya itamilo kome ya shaba, kila kitamilo kikibha nu kutandamala kwa mita jhimo na lobo itato, kujhanuka kwa mita jhimo na lobo itato, nu ukola mita jhimo na lobo. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />itamilo yenio ikibha itengenichwe kwa mabamba gha choma ghighabhii telatela ghighakamulii mu mafelemo, <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />helahela panane jha mabamba pakibha na inyagho cha maimba na kinyagho cha ng'ombi nkambako na ihumbe inamapapanilo ikemwa makelube, panane jha mabamba pakibha nu luunga lukupota picha yenie ikalembelekilwe kukuhalala. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Yene tuu jhe, kila kitamilo kikibha na mataile ncheche gha shaba, yoma ya panakate yu kutindiya mataile gheniya, ikibha ya shaba. Mu ikamulilo ncheche ya itamilo kukibha na ibanilo yi shaba nhwalo ghu kukamulila kihulo kikolongwa. Kila kibanilo ngikibhekwa hingo jha malobha gha kuloka. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Kunane jha litangi lilibhii umutuka kipitii kilebhe ngita nnyango kujhenda kunane kuhikii nucho mita. Kwa panja nnyango ghulembwitwe tii ngote, na mabamba ghoha ghakibha kona yoha telatela hilu ikutindii jhe. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Na mataile ncheche gheniya ghakibha pahe jha mabamba, yoma ya panakate yu kutundikiya mataile gheniya ikibha ilombine ni mutuka jhenio, nu kola kwa mataile gheniya ikibha chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Mataile gheniya ghakibha ngita mataile gha mutuka iuhutwa na falache yu kungondo, na yoma yake yu kukamulila mataile, mu mataile ghake na ikombe yake, yenie yoha ikibha jha shaba jhukutapaa. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Kila kitamilo kikibha na ikamulilo ncheche na kila kona jhimo kikamulilo chimo, yenie ikayanwii pamonga nde na mutuka. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Na panane jha kila mutuka pakibha nuutepe ghuteila mu mulobhulo gwa mataile ghukibha nu ukolo gwa chentimita makome mabhele niibhele, na kila ikamulilo na mabamba ghakibha upande ghu kunane ukamulina nde na mutuka jhenie. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Kila chehemo mu kikamulilo na mabamba gha kila itamilo, Hilamo ngabhacha makelube ghina mapapanilo na liimba ni mikongo jhi mitende na ngatindikiya na malobha ghu kulembelekeya. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Itamilo yoha kome ikibha aina jhimo yukutapaa na ikulandana, kwa kipemo chimo.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Peniya, ngatengenicha ihulo kome ya shaba, kila chimo kikibha nujhanuko gwa mita ibhele na lihoto kutweleya mache lita miya nane na chemanine. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Ngabheka itamilo nhwano upande gwa kuchine gwa Nyumba jha Chapanga na henge nhwano upande gwa kachikachine. Ngabheka kihulo chela upande gwa kuchine, mu kimbeketule cha kuchine mwa Nyumba jha Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe ibhii mu Nyumba jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Ngongu 4:11-5:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Helahela Hilamo ngatengenicha ihulo na machepeto na mabilika. Yene ndi Hilamo chajhomolikiya lihengo lyoha lya Nyumba jha Chapanga ngita hela munahota nkolongwa Chelemane chalaghalikiya, <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />heke ibhele na mabakule mabhele ghighalandine na hingo ibhekitwe panane jha heke yenie na lwaho ibhele kunhwalo gwa kuyekelela hingo ibhele yenio. <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />Makomamanga miya ncheche kunhwalo gwa lwaho yenio ibhele ibhii na michitale mibhele jha makomamanga kwa kila lwaho, ghalembelikiya hingo ibhele ilandana na bakule panane jha heke yenio, <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />na itamilo ncheche pamonga na machiniya kome, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />na kihulo chimo chela na inyagho ya makambako kome na mabhele pahe jha kihulo chenio. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Helahela ngatenginicha machupuliya na machepeto na mabakule gha kumichila. Yombo yenio yoha ikibha ya shaba ing'alita, yantengenichila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane, kunhwalo gwa Nyumba jha Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Munahota nkolongwa ngalaghila ilebhe yoha itengenechwa kukutapaa ku lulambo lwa lukemba Yoludane, chehemo jhibhii nu undope gwa kikandango ghubhii pakate jha Sukote na Saletane. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngaileka ilebhe yenio yoha changapema nhwalo ikibha yamahele hake na utopau gwa shaba ukamanyikini jhe.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Helahela munahota nkolongwa ngatenginicha ilebhe ya bei ngolongwa mu Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, ilebhe yenio ndi, chehemo jhukipiikiya matambiko kwa chaabo na chehemo jhikubheke mabumunda kwa chaabo, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />ngatenginicha chehemo jhikubheke kolobohe kwa chaabo jhambone, nhwano upande ghu lubhoko lwalelo na nhwano upande gwa lubhoko lwa ngejha, palonge jha chumbe cha nkate na malobha gha chaabo na kolobohe na ikamulilo kwa chaabo, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />na machiniya gha chaabo jhambone na mikache yu kubheke ndambe na mabakule gha kumichila na itecho yukututukiya ubane na ijhokolelo ya mwotu, yoha ikatengenichwe kwa chaabo jhambone na bawaba jha milyango jha chehemo jha nkate jha nyumba, chehemo jhela jha nyahinyahi hake na bawaba ya milyango jha udamo gwa Nyumba jha Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Yene ndi munahota nkolongwa Chelemane chajhomolila kutengenecha Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngaijhingiya nkate ilebhe yenio yoha, kongo Daude tatemundo ngailenganikiya kuhwalo jha lihengo lya Bhambo Chapanga, yane madine gha feza na chaabo na hyombo henge, peniya, ngabhekita mu kihukilo mu Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lichanduko lya Lilaghano liletwa ku Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Ngongu 5:2-6:2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngabhakema akanahota pamonga na ilongoche ya makabila na ilongoche ya ngolo yoha yaka Ichilahele bhakongane ku Yeluchalemo, kupala kulitola Lichanduko lya Lilaghano kubhoke ku Siyone yane muche gwa Daude. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Bhando bhoha ngabhakonganika nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa Chelemane, kipinde cha unyagho, mu mwehe gwa Etanimo yane mwehe gwa chaba. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Kipinde akanahota bheniya pibhakonganika kwenio, akapiya matambiko ngabhalighegha lichanduko lyenio lya Lilaghano, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Akalabhe na akapiya matambiko ngabhahamicha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na Lihema lya Nyahinyahi na yombo yoha ya nyahinyahi ikibha mwenio mu lihema. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pamonga na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele ngabhakongana nnonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na ngabhapiita matambiko gha mambelele na ng'ombi twe yangabhalangika. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Peniya, akapiya matambiko ngibhilijhingiya Lichanduko lyenie chehemo jha chumbe cha nkate cha Nyahinyahi Hake, pahe jha mapapanilo gha ihumbe ikemwa makelube. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Makelube gheniya ngaghajhinwila mapapanilo ghake panane jha lichanduko ku yene lichanduko pamonga na michegha jhake jhikibha pahe jha mapapanilo. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Michegha jhenio jhikibha mitandamaho hake pu udamo ghukemwa Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi, nnonge jha chumbe cha nkate pipakemwa Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi, nambo ibhonikina jhe ade panja. Michegha jhenio ibhii koko kwenio ade ngohe. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Kikibha jhe kilebhe chenge nkate jhi Lichanduko lya Lilaghano nambo ibau ya maghanga ndo yabheka Mucha kwenio ku Holebo, peniya Bhambo Chapanga pabheka Lilaghano na aka Ichilahele pibhakibha bhabhoka ku Michile.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Peniya, akapiya matambiko ngibhapitita Chehemo jhela jha Nyahinyahi, lihunde ngilitanda nu kuyekelela nyumba jhu kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />akapiya matambiko ngibhalepilila kuhenga mahengo ghabhe ghi upiya litambiko nhwalo gwa kung'ala kwa Bhambo Chapanga kukukibha mu nyumba jhake. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Peniya, Chelemane ngajhopa kukulonge, “Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga nginnongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">‘Nantama pu lubhendo tyoo.’<verse eid="1KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Chakaka ninchengii nyumba ngolongwa jhina kuhalala hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:13">chehemo jhukutama machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chelemane ilonge na bhando</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Ngongu 6:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Peniya, Chelemane ngabhaghalambukila aka Ichilahele bhoha kone bhajhemengine, ngabhajhope mota, <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />ngalonge, “Alombwe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, nhwalo gwa makakala ghake alenganikiye malaghano ghalaghina na tategwango Daude palongila, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Kubhoke lichiko lela lyanabhohita bhando bhango aka Ichilahele kukilambo chuku Michile, nikahagwii jhe nyumba jhojhoha mu makabila gha aka Ichilahele kupala bhanjengele nyumba mombo kujhinamila, nambo nikanhagwii Daude malongoche bhando bhango.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Chelemane ngajhendilila kulonge, kuyene, tategwango apata kunchenge Bhambo Chapanga nyumba jha kunnyimila, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, tate gwango Daude, “Kilebhe chambone nhwachite umwojho gwino kunjenge ne nyumba. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Nambo mwe ndeka jhumbakuchenge nyumba jhukunyinamila, nambo mwana gwino ndi jwambakunjenge ne nyumba jhenio.”<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />Na ngohe Bhambo Chapanga alenganikiye lyalaghina nhwalo ne ngohe nanahota nakolongwa chehemo jha tategwango Daude, ndamii kigoda chulongoche gwa aka Ichilahele na ngohe chengite nyumba jhi kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Helahela mekite chehemo pukubheke Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na mu lyenio ndi muibhii ibau ya maghanga ibhabheka lilaghano Bhambo Chapanga kwa akahokobhito, kipinde chibhabhohita ku kilambo chuku Michile.<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujhopo lwa Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2 Ngongu 6:12-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Peniya, Chelemane ngajhema nnonge jha chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jha Bhambo Chapanga, kone akibha nnonge jha aka Ichilahele bhoha ngatondobhiya mabhoko ghake kunane, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />ngalonge, “Mwe Ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, abhii jhe Chapanga jhonge ngita mwenga, kunane kwa Chapanga amu pahe pannema! Mwenga ndi jhumuhobholeka, nnenganikiye lilaghano lino kwa bhando bhino nakwalangiya bhando bhino upalo bhibhatama kwa kunnyokonikiya kwa mwojho gwabhe ghoha. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Nnenganikiye lilaghano lino lyamunnaghila ntumiche gwino Daude tategwango, deleno nnenganikiye ghoha ghimalongila kwa makakala ghino mabhene. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Ngohe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, ninnyopa yene nnenganikiye lilaghano lyamunnaghila ntumiche gwino Daude tate gwango, punnongila, machiko ghoha napabhaha na jhumo pakate jha kibheluko chino, jwapakutama pa kigoda cha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, ngita ibheluko ino nihobholeka ngita chimatenda mwenga nnonge jhango. <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, deleno ninnyopa nnenganikiye ghoha ghimalaghana na ntumiche gwino Daude tategwango.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Nambo chakaka mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga nhwotwii kutama pannema? Anda ibhii kunane kwa Chapanga na kunane hake mwe inkwela jhe, nyumba jhenje jhanjengite najhinkwela bhole? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, ne natumiche bhino niinnyopa unyeketele kujhopa kwango kuninnyopa deleno. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Mwilonde nyumba jhenje kilo na muhe, pimapahagwile mabhene kubhehe chehemo jhukunnyinamila malongela kubhehe, ‘Pamba ndi pimbakutama,’ unyoha pimbakuika kujhopa pamba kongo nikalolekeya chehemo jhenje. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Unyohe kujhopa kwango ne natumiche bhino pamonga na bhando bhino aka Ichilahele pibhajhopa bhabhii kulolekeya chehemo jhenje. Nnyohe kujhopa kubhoke kwenio kunane kumitama na anda nnyohine mutulekekeye.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Anda mundo annemwite nnyake na jwenio aletitwe kulapila nnonge jha chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko ghino mu Nyumba jhenje, najwenio anda alapii, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />chonde Bhambo Chapanga nnyohe kubhoke kunane, mahadabula akatumiche bhino jwabhii na malemwa tela na malemwa ghake. Na jwangalemwa munneke ajhabhule tela na kuhobholeka kwake.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Anda bhabhii bhando bhino aka Ichilahele bhabulitwe na akamakoko bhabhe nhwalo gwa uhakaho ghubhatehile kwino mwenga, na anda bheniya bhajheketile nukughalambukila kwa liina lino mu Nyumba jhenje, bhakannyopa kukutembekeya kupala malekekeye, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />peniya, majhokanikiya kubhoke kwenio kunane kwa Chapanga, malekekeye uhakaho gwabhe bhando bhino aka Ichilahele, na mabhujhicha mu kilambo chabhe chimapila akahoko bhabhe.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Anda hula jhikotwike kukoma nhwalo bhando bhino bhantendii uhakaho, na bheniya bhannyopite nu kulilomba liina lino kukulolekeya chehemo jhenje nu kughalambuka kukuleka uhakaho gwabhe, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />chonde majhokanikiya kubhoke kwenio kunane kwa Chapanga. Nu kughalekekeya uhakaho gwa akatumiche bhino na bhando bhuku Ichilahele, na kwabhola kutenda ghambone. Peniya, makomalekeye hula pikilambo chimapila bhando bhino kubhehe chabhe machiko ghoha.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Kipinde mu kilambo pipitii njala ngolongwa amu malwalo ghighakemwa taune amu pangakoma hula amu mimeya ihalabiigwe nupepo amu mambalangule muipandwa amu madidima amu mabhongo amu bhando bhino bhajhingililwe na akamakoko bhabhe amu kupitii malwalo ghoghoha, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />chonde majhokanikiya bhando bhino aka Ichilahele kujhopa kwabhe. Kila mundo anda akumanye kulagha kwake umwojho anda annyopite kongo akatondobheya mabhoko ghake kukulolekeya mu nyumba jhenje, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />bhahe, majhoha kubhoke kunane kwa Chapanga na malekekeye bhando bhino na kwatangatila. Nhwalo mwenga jhikajhino ndi maghamanye mawacho gha miojho jha bhando bhino bhoha. Munnolekeya kila mundo tela na itendwa yake, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />kupala bhando bhino bhanyokonikiya machiko ghoha pibhatama mu kilambo chimapila akahoko bhito.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Helahela anda mundo nng'ene Mwichilahele ndeka, anda aikite kubhoke kukilambo cha kutale kuhwalo gwa kunnyinamila, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />kunhwalo bhando bhilambo henge bhijhoha kulumbililwa kwino na kunhwalo gwa makakala ghino, mundo jwenio anda innyinamii abhii kukulolekeya nyumba jhenje, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />ninnyopa munyokanikiya kubhoke kwenio kunane, na mapela channyopite kupala bhando bhoha pannema pano bhilimanye liina lino nu kuntembekeya ngita pibhampwelela aka Ichilahele, helahela bhamanye kubhehe nyumba jhenje jhanjengite, imanyikana kwa liina lino.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Bhando bhino anda bhajhawii kungondo kubulana na akamakoko bhabhe, anda bhannyopite mwenga kokoha kumapakwapeleka na bheniya kunnyopa anda bhabhii kukuloleya muche ghumuhagwile na nyumba jhinjengite kunhwalo gwa kunnyinamila, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />bhahe, majhokanikiya kujhopa kwabhe. Kongo mmii kwenio kunane na matendele ngita chiipalwa,<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Anda bhando bhatehi uhakaho, nhwalo abhii jhe mundo jwanga tenda uhakaho na mwenga anda machimwite na kwaleka bhalepele na akamakoko bhabhe ade kutolwa kwa makakala kwapeleka ku ilambo ya akamakoko bhabhe yu kutale amu ya pahina, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />na anda nabhaghalambula miojho jhabhe mu ilambo ibhabhabhii akabhanda, na bheniya bhajheketile nu bhannyopite kukulonge, tutei uhakaho, <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />anda bhabhii kwenio kubhatohilwe kwa makakala bhalapii uhakaho gwabhe nu kunnyinamila kongo bhakalolekaya kukilambo chenje chamapii akatate bhabhe, muche ghumuhagwile na Nyumba jhenje jhinninchengile kunnyinamila, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />bhahe, majhokanikiya kujhopa kwabhe. Kwenio kunane kumitama majhoha kujhopa kwabhe na matangatila ghala ghighapalwa. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Malekekeya bhando bhino uhakaho gwabhe ghubhantendii na malemwa ghabhe. Mabhonela kiya nnonge jha akamakoko bhabhe kupala na bheniya bhakolela kiya, <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />kunhwalo bheniya ndi bhando bhino bhimabhohita ku kilambo chuku Michile kubhoke mu kulagha kukolongwa.”<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />Nnyokanikiya kujhopa kwa ntumiche gwino na kujhopa kwa bhando bhino aka Ichilahele, kila pibhannelela majhokanikiya. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo pimahagwila kubhehe bhando bhino, pakate jha bhando bhoha pannema kupala bhabhaha bhando bhino mabhene ngita pintangicha kupete ntumiche gwino Mucha, kipinde pimabhohita kukilambo chuku Michile.<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujhopo lukujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Chelemane pajhomolila kunyopa Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhema nnonge chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko pakibha atamite makilikite kongo ahatambwii mabhoko ghake kunane. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Ngajhema na kwajhope mota aka Ichilahele bhoha kulilobhe likolongwa bhibhakongine peniya kwa Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Alombwe Bhambo Chapanga, jwabhapii kupomolela bhando bhake Akaichilahele ngita chalaghina. Alenganikiye ilebhe yoha yalaghila kupete ntumiche jwake Mucha. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito abha na twenga, ngita chakibha na akahoko bhito, tujhopa angatuleka jhe. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Jwenie atutende tung'alambukile kupala tukengame ndela jhake, kongo tuikamula mihilo jhake pamonga na malaghalikilo ghake ghabhapila akahoko bhito. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Na majhopo ghanga ghinijhopa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ghabhaha pahina na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, nijhopa ajhendelela kukombokela malobhe ghukujhopa kwito kilo na muhe, na machiko ghoha bhabhonela kiya bhando bhake aka Ichilahele, kupala bhapela ilebhe yabhapala ya kila machiko ghoha. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Yene, bhando bhoha pannema kupala bhamanya kubhehe chakaka Bhambo Chapanga ndi Chapanga abhii jhe jhonge. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Na mangota mma bhimihobholeka kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito nu mikengama mihilo jhake pamonga na kujhokanikiya malaghalikilo ghake ghoha ngita chimitenda deleno.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chelemane ikamuya Nyumba kwa Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Ngongu 7:4-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pamonga na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele bhakibha nabho pena ngabhaleta inyama kumpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga matambiko. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Chelemane ngampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga matambiko gha uteeke na ng'ombe elufo ichiline niibhele na mambelele lake jhimo na elufo ichiline. Yene, ndi munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pamonga na Ichilahele chibhakamwiya Nyumba jhenio jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Lichiko lele, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngakamwiya chehemo jha pakate jha chumbe cha udamo, chikibhii palonge jha nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga nhwalo pena ndi chehemo Chelemane papiikiya matambiko ghu kukomelekeya na matambiko gha mbonje pamonga na matambiko gha mahuta gha uteeke. Ateila yene, nhwalo chehemo jhela jhikatengenichwe kwa shaba jhikupiikiya matambiko, ikibha njokombe hake kwa matambiko gheniya.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Bhahe, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngabheka unyagho ghu ichimba kukipinde cha machiko chaba na ngajhonjeke machiko chaba ghange yane machiko kome na ncheche, pakibha bhando twe hake, bhakapitii kutumbulii ku lijhingililo li kachikachine mwa Hamate ade kumpaka mwa kukipela chuku Michile. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Lichiko lya nane, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngabhatawika bhando na bheniya ngabhannyope mota munahota nkolongwa Chelemane. Peniya, ngabhajhawila kajhabhe, kongo bhakapeta kuhanganila nu kululutila kukuhala mwojho, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akantendii ghambone Daude ntumiche jwake pamonga na bhando bhake Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga impitii kabhele Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Ngongu 7:11-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pajhomolila kuchenga nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na nyumba jhake jha kinahota na ilebhe yoha yapala kuhenga, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngampitila kabhele ngita champitila kwenio ku Gebione. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane kubhehe, “Nyohine kujhopa kwino na chimijhopa, nenga nijhelewiye nyumba jhenie kubhehe kupala bhando bhanyinamila mwenio machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Ne naniilonda nu kuijhemelela machiko ghoha. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Na mwenga anda undumikii kwa mwojho gwino gwoha nu kukuhobholeka ngita tate gwino Daude, na anda mijhokanikii mihilo jhango nu kulenganikiya ghoha ghininnaghalikiya, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />nenga nannikangamalicha ulongoche gwino kilambo chuku Ichilahele machiko ghoha ngita channaghina Daude tate gwino kubhehe, Napelulwa jhe mundo jwa kulongocha munahota gwa aka Ichilahele machiko ghoha ghangapeta.” <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Nambo mangota na yana ino nng'alamwike nu kuleka kungengama nenga nu kuikamu jhe malaghalikilo ghango na mihilo jhango jhinimpehile na mangota kujhenda kuitumikii ichapanga yenge nukuijhimila, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />bhahe, nanahamicha bhando bhango aka Ichilahele mu kilambo chenje chinapile na kuikana nyumba jhenje jhinyeketile kubhehe jhango. Ndi bhando bha ilambo henge nabhaheka nu kumpucha. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Kabhele nyumba jhenje jhipa kutilukana nu kubhehe lihame, kila mundo jwapakuibhona nachituka nu kukikonya kubhehe, Kwanike Bhambo Chapanga ateii naha kwa kilambo chenje na nyumba ejhe? <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Bhando bhange nabhajhanga, “Ku nhwalo bhando bheniya bhannekite Bhambo Chapanga jwabhe, jwabhabhohita akahoko bhabhe kukilambo chuku Michile nu kuikengama ichapanga yenge, Bhambo Chapanga abhaletii malwalo gheniya.”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chelemane imeka lujheketelano na Hilamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:1-2">2 Ngongu 8:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Mupehekelo mwa chaka cha makome mabhele mwenio Chelemane ngachenga nyumba ibhele yane nyumba jha Chapanga na nyumba jhi kinahota, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngampila Hilamo munahota nkolongwa jwaku Tilo miche makome mabhele munkowa gwaku Galilaya, nhwalo Hilamo akampekii munahota nkolongwa Chelamane mbau yi mieleze pamonga na mikongo jha mibeloshe pamonga na chaabo ngita chiipalitwa. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Nambo Hilamo pajhahwila ku Tilo kulolekeya miche yenio, likanhanganiche jhe. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Peniya, Hilamo ngankonya Chelemane, “Malongo bhango, miche ghane jhumbile?” Ndi nhwalo miche yenio ikemwa Kabul, yane ilambo ya kimbebhebhe, ibhii ade ngohe. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hilamo akibha ampelikii munahota nkolongwa Chelemane chaabo kilo elufo tato miya chita.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengo ghange gha Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2 Ngongu 8:3-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Nghanga malobhe gha munahota nkolongwa Chelemane chibhahengicha bhando lihengo lya kuchokelekeya lya kuchenga Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga na nyumba jha kinahota nkolongwa na liboma li ku Milo na lipamanda li ku Yeluchalemo. Helahela ngabhachokolikiya bhando bheniya kuchenga kabhele miche jha Hazole na Megido pamonga na Gezele. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Falao munahota nkolongwa jhuku Michile akate kuujhingilila nu kutola muche gwa Gezele na ngaujhocha mwotu na ngabhakoma Akakanane bhibhatama mwenio. Peniya, palonge kamwale jwa Falao patolilwa na Chelemane, munahota nkolongwa Falao ngampila kamwale jwake muche gwenio gwa Gezele ubhehe hupo jha unyagho gwa ndowa. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Chelemane ngachenga kabhele muche gwenio gwaku Gezele helahela ngachenga kabhele Bete Holone jha pahe, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />pamonga na miche jha Baalate na Tamale miche jhibhii kunjenga kukilambo chuku Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />helahela ngachenga ikoko yukubheke ilebhe yake henge, na ngachenga liboma lyukubheke falache yake na ngachenga liboma pukubheke mutuka yukuhutwa na falache. Helahela ngachenga ilebhe henge yaipala jwene mu kilambo chuku Yeluchalemo pamonga nuku Lebanone pamonga na kilambo choha chalongwicha. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Bhando bhange bhibhahighilike pakate jha aka Amole na Akahite na aka Peliche na aka Hive pamonga na aka Yebuche, bhoha bhakibha jhe bhando bhuku Ichilahele, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />pamonga na ibheluko yabhe bhibhahighilika kukilambo, aka Ichilahele bhakomitii jhe, bheniya Chelemane ngabhachokolikiya kuhenga mahengo ngita chibhii ade deleno. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Nambo Chelemane bhatehi jhe aka Ichilahele kubhehe akabhanda, bhamba ndi ngabhabheka kubhehe akakomana ngondo na bhange ilongoche ya ulongoche gwake na bhange akatumiche bha ulongoche gwake na bhange akatumiche bhake na bhange ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo na bibhahobhoke mutuka yukuhutwa na falache na bhibhahobhoke falache.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Na ilongoche ikolongwa bhakibha bhando miya nhwano na amuchine. Bheniya ndi bhibhajhemelela bhando kuhenga mahengo kwa munahota nkolongwa Chelemane.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Kubhoke pa bite Falao kuhama kuhumii ku muche gwa Daude nu kujhenda kunyumba jhi kinahota nkolongwa jhanchengila Chelemane, bhahe, Chelemane ngachenga liboma li ku Milo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Chelemane ngapiya matambiko mala patato kwa chaka kwa Bhambo Chapanga, matambiko ghu kukomelekeya pamonga na matambiko gha uteeke chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko jhanchengila Bhambo Chapanga na ngahukulikiya ubane. Yene, ngajhomolila kuchenga Nyumba jha Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngatendekeya mingalabha mikolongwa twe ku muche jha Ezione Gebele, pahina na muche ghuku Elate pambwane jha Shamo, mu kilambo chuku Edomo. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Na munahota nkolongwa Hilamo ngabhatuma akatumiche bhake bhibhamanye ilebhe umache na bheniya ngabhahenga mahengo umele pamonga na akatumiche bha Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Ngabhajhendecha kujhenda kukilambo chuku Ofile nu kuhumii kwenio ngabhaleta chaabo kilo elufo kome na ncheche nu kunnete munahota nkolongwa Chelemane.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Linyongolo lyuku Sheba intyangi munahota nkolongwa Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Ngongu 9:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Linyongolo lyuku Sheba pajhohina malobhe gha Chelemane pahina gwake na Bhambo Chapanga, ngannyendelela Chelemane kupala kuntegha kukunkonya machwale majhundupahu. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Ngajhenda kwenio ku Yeluchalemo kongo abhii na akatumiche bhake ndii, pamonga na ngamiya ndii igheghite mahuta ghina kunungilila petelele pamonga na chaabo na maghanga gha bei ngolongwa. Chelemane pammona ngannyambucha linyongolo lyenio, na linyongolo jwenio pahikita kwa Chelemane ngankonyita machwale ndii hake ghakibha nagho. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Jwenio Chelemane ngajhangwila machwale ghoha, likibha jhe lichwale lyalepelile kujhangula. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Linyongolo lya ku Sheba ngakangicha pahweina malango ghoha gha munahota nkolongwa Chelemane pajhangwila kwa malango na paiweina nyumba jhikinahota nkolongwa, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />kabhele ngakibhona chakulya chikiletitwe pakichangwale cha Chelemane, na ilongoche yake pibhatamite pakichangwale, na akatumiche chibhawalite makanjo ghabhe maha na bhando bhibhatekana yu kunywe na matambiko ghu kukomelekeya ghighapihwa ku Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngahechwika nu kukangacha hake. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Peniya, ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa, chakaka ilebhe yoha inyohina ku kilambo chango na ilebhe mbwe ino na malango ghino ghalenganile! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Nambo nikakung'ii jhe mihalo jhenio ade panaika namwene kuibhona ilebhe yenio. Ata yene bhannobholii jhe ilebhe yoha wala nucho jhake bhalongii jhe, malango ghino pamonga ni ilebhe ino kupeta panajhohagha. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Bhina mota bhando bhino! Na kabhele bhina mota akatumiche bhino bhibhajhema nnonge jhino kongo kupeta na kujhokanikiya malango ghino! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Alombwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nhwalo jwenio ntehi ahalalichwe na mwenga ade ammekite mme manahota akolongwa bhikilambo chuku Ichilahele! Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ate kwapala bhando bhuku Ichilahele machiko ghoha ghangapeta, kabhele ammekite mwenga kubhehe manahota akolongwa kupala ntunja mihilo na umbone ngita chiipalwa.<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Peniya, linyongolo jwenio ngampila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane hupo yagheghite. Ngampila kuikii tane elufo ncheche ya chaabo pamonga na mahuta ghina kuningila njiii na maghanga gha bei ngolongwa. Ujholoko gwa mahuta ngita ghenio ghapekilwe munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ghinaletwa jhe kabhele ngita gheniya ade pa deleno.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Kabhele mwanja gwa mele jha munahota nkolongwa Hilamo jhuku Ofile ngailetita mikongo twe jha michandale pamonga na maghanga gha bei ngolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngaitumila ngita heke mikongo jhenio jha kutendekeya Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga na liboma pamonga nu kutendekeya nkangala pamonga na malimba ku nhwalo gwa bhando bhibhajhemba. Helahela kujholoka kwa mikongo ngita jhenio inawahii jhe kubhonekana ade deleno.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Helahela munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngampila linyongolo jwenio jhuku Sheba kila kilebhe chaghanita na kujhopa. Ngampila hupo henge ndii kupeta chabhapila bhange bhando bhibhawelita kuika peniya na ngita chibhayobhalii na umbone gwa kinahota nkolongwa. Jwenio pamonga na bhando bhake bhoha bhakibha nabho ngabhabhujha kukilambo chabhe.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe mbwe ya munahota nkolongwa Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Ngongu 9:13-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Kila chaka ngabhannetila munahota nkolongwa Chelemane kilo elufo ichiline niibhele ya chaabo. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Chaabo jhenio jhikibha panga jhonjekeya chaabo jhibhaleta bhando bhibhachulucha amu kode mu kuchulucha ilebhe ibhatohila akanahota bhoha bhuku Alabiya pamonga na akanahota bhoha bhu kilambo chuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Chelemane ngatendekeya ngao ngolongolo miya ibhele kwa chaabo jhiyanitwe, kila ngao ikibha na kilo chaba jha chaabo. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Kabhele ngatendekeya ngao njokonjoko miya itato kwa chaabo jhiyanitwe, kila ngao ikibha na kilo jhimo na nucho jha chaabo, peniya, munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngao yenio ngabheka mu nyumba jhikemitwa, Litogholo lya Lebanone.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Helahela akatengeniche kigoda kikolongwa chi kinahota nkolongwa kwa mino gha ndembo nu kulembeke chaabo jhambone jhiyanitwe. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Kigoda chenie kikibha na ngache chita yu kuhobhokela. Panane nu kunyuma jhi kigoda chenie kikabhilingine unyuma. Na kila upande pakibha na pukujheghemeke lubhoko, pakibha ni inyagho iliimba ijhemite pahupele jha kila upande. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Inyagho ya maimba kome na mabhele ngabhajhemeka muupele jha ngache chita, limo kila upande gwa ngache. Na hilu panapitii jhe kigoda cha kinahota nkolongwa ngita chenio.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Ikombe yoha yukunywelela munahota nkolongwa ikibha ya chaabo, na yombo yoha ikibha ibhekitwe ku nyumba jhikemitwa Litogholo lya Lebanone na yombo yoha ikatenganichwe kwa chaabo. Ikatenganichwe jhe kwa madine ghighakemwa Feza, nhwalo kipinde chenie madine gha feza ghakibha jhe na bei ngolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Helahela munahota nkolongwa Chelemane akibha na mele ngolongwa jhikujhende kukilambo chuku Talishishi pamonga na mele jha munahota nkolongwa Hilamo. Jhenie ubhujha kila jhimo kwa yaka itato ndi jhinnetila chaabo na madine gha feza na mino gha ndembo na majhane na ijhune ikemitwa tausi.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngabhila mundo jhuna ilebhe mbwe hake na jhuna malango hake kupeta akanahota akakolongwa bhoha pannema. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Bhando kuhumii kila chehemo pannema ngabhapala kujhenda kujhokanikiya malango ghapatite kuhumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Kila mundo ngannete hupo yake, yombo itendikilwe kwa madine gha feza na chaabo, pamonga na ngobho ina kuhalala na chilaa na mahuta ghina kunungilila njiii na falache pamonga na maponda. Hupo yenio apokila chaka ade chaka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Chelemane akibha na mutuka jhihutitwa na falache na bhando bhukuhobhoke mu falache, akibha na mutuka jhihutitwa na falache elufo jhimo na miya ncheche pamonga na akahobhoke falache elufo kome na bhabhele, bheniya ngabhabheka mu miche jhibhii na chehemo jhikubheke mutuka ghighahutwa na falache pahina na munahota nkolongwa, na ghange ghakibha ku Yeluchalemo. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Bhahe, munahota nkolongwa Chelamane ngaghatenda madine gha feza ngita maghanga ghange, kwenio ku Yeluchalemo, na mbau ya mieleze ikibha ndi ngita mbau ya mikongo mikojho jhimelite mu lulambo lwa mbwane. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Chelemane ngalaghila bhannete falache kuhumii ku Michile pamonga nu kukilambo chuku Kilikiya, kwenio akachulucha bhake bhakahemii kuhumii kwenio. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Mutuka jhimo jhikuhutwa kwa falache bhahemila kwa kilo chaba jha madine gha feza, na falache jhumo bhahemila kwa kilo ibhele ya madine gha feza. Akachulucha bha ilebhe ya munahota nkolongwa, ngabhapelika mutuka na falache yenio kwachuluchila akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bha Akahite na Akasiliya.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Chelemane ileka ndela jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Chelemane ngapala hake akakeghe akaghene, yene pukutumbula ngatolana na kamwale jhumo mwana jwa munahota nkolongwa jwaku Michile, helahela ngatolana na akakeghe bhuku Moabo na akakeghe bhuku Amone na akakeghe bhuku Edomo na akakeghe bhuku Sidone na akakeghe bhuku Hite. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Atolina na akakeghe bheniya, pamonga Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakelebhuya Akaichilahele kubhehe, “Mangatole jhe akakeghe aka Ichilahele na bhando bheniya bhangatole jhe achikamwale bhino nhwalo nabhannyambukiya kuijhinamila ichapanga yabhe.” Ata yene Chelemane ngajhendilila kwapala hake akakeghe bheniya. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Munahota nkolongwa Chelemane akatolile akakeghe miya chaba bhoha bhakibha yana ya akanahota akakolongwa na ilaghe yake ikibha miya itato. Akakeghe bheniya ngabhantenda Chelemane kwileka ndela jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Chelemane pakibha aghoime akaanamundo ngabhankolwiya ade ngatumbuu kuijhinamila ichapanga yuwange na hilu akibha ahobholika jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwake ngita Daude tatemundo chakibha ahobholika. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Yene, Chelemane ngajhinamila kichapanga mwikeghe Ashilote jwa bhando bhuku Sidone na aka Amone pijhanyinamila kichapanga Moleke ngabhantenda Chapanga achimwe. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Ata yene, Chelemane ngantendela uhakaho Bhambo Chapanga, hilu akankengimii jhe maha Bhambo Chapanga ngita chateila Daude, tatemundo. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Kabhele munahota nkolongwa Chelemane ngachenga chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko, ku kitombe chikibhii upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Yeluchalemo, nhwalo gwa kichapanga Kemoshi jwaku Moabo jwantenda Chapanga achimwe pamonga na kichapanga Moleke jwaku Amone jwantenda Chapanga jwa kwele achimwe. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Helahela ngachenga chehemo jhenge pukututukiya ubane nu kujhinamila ichapanga ya akaanamundo akaghene.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele ngannyomila Chelemane nhwalo akajhendilii jhe kuntumikila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele kanjika pamonga nukumpitii pabhele Chelemane, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />nu kunaghalikiya yene angajhinamii jhe ichapanga ya kighene, nambo Chelemane akajhokanikii jhe nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Chelemane, “Ku nhwalo nnekite kutenda ngita chinninaghila nu kukana mihilo jhinnimpile, chakaka, naniukenjula kutale ulongoche gwino nu kumpe ntumiche gwino. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Ata yene, ku nhwalo gwa Daude tate gwino ndenda jhe gheniya mu ughome gwino, nambo kipinde chapakulongocha mwana gwino nangenjulana. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Nangenjula jhe unahota nkolongwa ghoha, nambo nanimpela likabila limo ndo, ku nhwalo gwa ntumiche gwango Daude na ku nhwalo gwa muche ghuku Yeluchalemo, muche ghuniuhagwii kubhehe chango.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akamakoko bha Chelemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngantenda Hadade jhu lukolo lu kinahota nkolongwa luku Edomo kubhehe likoko lya Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Kipinde Daude pabhajhingilila aka Edomu na kwakoma, Yoabo jwakibha kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo bha Daude ngajhenda kwenio kwachika Akaichilahele bhibhakomitwe. Kwenio ndi Yoabo ngabhakoma akanalome bhoha bhuku Edomo. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabo na aka Ichilahele ngatama myehe chita pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake, kupala bhakome akanalome bhoha bhuku Edomo. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Nambo Hadade pakibha kangombo jwandina nganyogholikila ku Michile, pamonga na Akaedomo, akatumiche bha tatemundo. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Ngabhajhenda ku Mediane, ngabhatola bhando bhange kwenio ku Palane. Kwenio ngabhajhendele ade ku Michile ku munahota nkolongwa Falao, munahota jwa kilambo chenie. Falao ngampila Hadade nyumba na nkuto gwa nng'onda, na ngalaghila akatumiche bhake bhampe Hadade chakulya. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Falao ngampala hake Hadade. Yene ngantolanikicha nnamomundo, unung'una jwa linyongolo Tapenese atolelwe na Hadade. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Peniya, aana bha Hadade ngampapila mwana munalome, ngankema liina lyake Genubete. Genubete ngabhampelika kwa linyongolo Tapenese aana bha Falao, kunyumba jhi kinahota nkolongwa kupala alelelwe pamonga na yana ya Falao, munahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Nambo Hadade kipinde pakibha kwenio ku Michile, ngajhoha kubhehe Daude pamonga na Yoabo, nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo bhajhomwike, ngannobholila Falao, “Unyeketele mujhe mu kilambo chango.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Nambo Falao ngankonya Hadade, “Mpelwii nike kwango ade mipala mmujhe mu kilambo chino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Hadade ngajhendilila kunyopa kukulonge, “Ninnyopa unyeketele nyabhule kajhango.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Helahela Chapanga ngantenda Lezone mwana jwa Eliada abhe likoko jwa Chelemane. Lezone akate kunyogholoka ku munahota nkolongwa gwake, Hadadezele, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Kubhoke pa Daude kwakoma bhando bhuku Soba, Lezone ngabheka kibhogha cha akakomana ngondo chikighalwike na jwenie ngabhila kilongoche jwabhe. Kibhogha chenie ngakijhenda ku Damachiko nukutola kilambo nu kulongocha. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Lezone ngabhila likoko jwa Akaichilahele kipinde munahota nkolongwa Chelemane palongwicha, nganchumbwiya hake Chelemane ngita Hadade panchumbwiya Chelemane. Yene, Lezone ngalongwicha kilambo cha Alamo kone abhachimwa aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ilaghana na Yeloboamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Mundo jhonge jwang'alambwika Chelemane akibha Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nabate, jwa likabila lya Efulahimo, jwahumii ku Zeleda. Jwenio akibha ntumiche jwa Chelemane majhemundo akibha nahwela jwakemitwa abite Zeluwa. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Ghongo ndi nhwalo ghukughaluka kwenio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:27">Chelemane ngayelila mabhomba nu kutendekeya ngache ikemitwa Milo, yukujhende kulipamanda lya muche gwa tatemundo Daude.<verse eid="1KI 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Chelemane pammona Yeloboamo kubhehe mundo jhuna makakala na jwangajhoghopa, ngahagwila kubhehe ntumiche jwa kujhemelela mahengo ghoha gha kuchokolekeya mu nyumba jha Uchupo. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Lichiko limo, Yeloboamo pakibha umwanja kubhoka ku Yeluchalemo, undela ngakongina na nnondole Ahiya jhuku Shilo kongo ahwalite lijhoho liyono, bhakibha bhabhele tuu kwenio kubhakongina ku mighonda. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ahiya ngaula lijhoho liyono lyenio na ngajwepulina ipande kome niibhele, <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />ngannobholila Yeloboamo, “Ntole ipande kome yenie nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele, anobholii naha, ‘Dola, nikenjuu unahota nkolongwa gwa Chelemane nukumpeke mwenga makabila kome.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Nambo Chelemane naninnekela likabila limo tuu kwa nhwalo gwa ntumiche gwango Daude pamonga na kilambo chuku Yeluchalemo, chihagwile mu Ichilahele jhoha. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Mba kutenda yene nhwalo Chelemane andendii ajhinamii ichapanga jhikighene ngita yene, Ashilote kichapanga kikeghe chuku Sidone na kichapanga Kemoshe chuku Moabo pamonga na kichapanga Moleke chuku Amone. Chelemane ang'alambwike nu kutenda uhakaho nnonge jhango, kabhele akamwii jhe malaghalikilo ghango na mihilo jhango ngita tatemundo Daude chakamwila. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Ata yene, nanimpoka jhe unahota nkolongwa gwake ghoha, nitehi abhehe kilongoche mughome gwake, kunhwalo gwa ntumiche gwango Daude jhunihagwile na jwenio jwajhokanikiya mihilo na malaghalikilo ghango. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Nambo nanimboka unahota nkolongwa kubhoke mwana gwake, nukumpe mwenga ma Yeloboamo makabila kome, <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />nambo mwana jwa Chelemane nanimpela likabila limo tuu, kupala kipinde choha lungolo lwa Daude lubhaha lumule lulung'ala, kila kipinde nnonge jhango pamba pamuche ghuku Yeluchalemo pihagwile, kubhehe chehemo jhango pu kujhinamila. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Mwe ma Yeloboamo nanimeka mme manahota makolongwa bhuku Ichilahele, na mwenga nanongocha ngita chimipala. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Na anda mughome gwino nnenganikiye ghoha ghuninnaghalikiye, nu kutenda ghambone nnonge jhango ku kukamuu malaghalikilo ghango na mihilo jhango ngita chateila ntumiche gwango Daude chatendagha, ne ndi namma pamonga na mwenga machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Nanintenda mme manahota makolongwa bha kilambo chango chuku Ichilahele na nimpela lukolo lwino kulongocha kuhumii pino mwenga. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Kubhoke mu malemwa gha Chelemane mbakwachwapula ibheluko ya Daude nambo kukipinde tugha.<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Bhahe, Chelemane ngapala kunkoma Yeloboamo nambo Yeloboamo ngatilii kukilambo chuku Michile, ku munahota nkolongwa Shishake, ngatama kwenio ade Chelemane pajhomwika.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhwe kwa Chelemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Ngongu 9:29-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Ilebhe henge ya Chelemane na malango ghake ijhandikwe Mukitabo Chiitendwa ya Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Chelemane ngalongwicha kilambo chuku Ichilahele ku kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche, kitamo chake kikolongwa kikibha ku Yeluchalemo. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Peniya, Chelemane ngajhomwika ngabhanchika ku muche gwa Daude tatemundo, na Leoboamo mwana jwa Chelemane ngabhila munahota nkolongwa chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gha upande gwa kachikachine ghing'alambuka Yeoboamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Ngongu 10:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Peniya, Leoboamo ngajhenda ku Shekemo, kwenio aka Ichilahele bhakibha bhakongine kupala kummeka abhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Na Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nebate jwakibha ku Michile kuntila Chelemane, pajhoha kilebhe chenie ngabhujha kuhumii ku Michile. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Nambo aka Ichilahele ngabhatuma bhando kunkema Yeloboamo. Peniya, jwenio pamonga na bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, ngabhannyendelila Leoboamo nu kunnobholela, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Tate gwino Chelemane akibha atutendita ngita akabhanda nu kutulepecha kode ngolongwa, deleno mutupongochele gheniya na twenga natutumikila.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Leoboamo ngabhajhangwila, “Nnyendengane kubhoke pamachiko matato nhwikangana.” Bhahe, bheniya ngabhajhendangana.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ngapala kumanya bhilonge bhole kwa ilongoche bhibhakibha bhantumikila Chelemane tatemundo pakibha ghome, ngakonyagha, “Bho, unobholele, najhanga nike bhando bhamba?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Akanahota bheniya ngabhannobholila, “Anda deleno mpahi kwatumikii mbone, bhahe, majhanga ghambone na bheniya nabhantumikila maha machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Nambo Leoboamo ngakana kwajhokanikiya akanahota, na ngabhajhendila achikangombo bhandanga jhake bhibhantumikila. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Ngabhakonya, “Mangota unobholele nalobholela nike bhando bhamba bhibhanobholii kubhehe napongochele mahengo majhundupahu ghabhapila tate gwango?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Achikangombo bheniya ngibhanyangwila, “Bhando bheniya bhibhannobholii tategwino bhapekii mahengo majhundupahu, ngabhannyopa mapongochele mahengo gheniya, mwe malobholela naha, ‘Mwenga namachokolekeya hake kuliku ghala ghampila tate gwango.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Tate gwango akampii mahengo majhundupahu nambo nenga nanimpela mahengo majhundupahu hake. Tate gwango ambulita kwa bakola jha mikela jha ndomondo nambo nenga nanichwapula kwa luyato lwa mibha!<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Kubhoke pa machiko matato Yeloboamo pamonga na bhando bhoha ngabhabhujha ku munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ngita chalaghila. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ngabhajhangwila bhando bhala ku kupwatalila, ngaleka ghala ghalobholilwe na akanahota, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />ngaghakengima ghalobholilwe na achikangombo ajhake, ngabhalobholila, “Tategwango ngampila mahengo majhundupahu nambo nenga nanimpela mahengo majhundupahu hake. Tategwango ngabulita kwa bakola jha mikela jha ndomondo nambo nenga nanimbula kwa bakola jha mikela jha ndomondo jhina ndoana.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Yene, munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo akajhokanikiii jhe bhando nhwalo kilebhe chenie kitendigwa na Bhambo Chapanga kupala kulenganikiya nhwalo gwalobholilwa Yeloboamo, mwana jwa Nebate, kupete nnondole jwa Chapanga Ahiya jhuku Shilo.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Bhahe, aka Ichilahele bhoha pipalola kubhehe munahota nkolongwa bhajhokanikii jhe ngabhalobholila, “Twe tubhii jhe pamonga na Daude tukwetii jhe chehemo jhito kwa mwana jwa Yese. Mangota mabhando bhuku Ichilahele nkelebhuke ukajha, mangota mabhando bhuku Ichilahele! Mitunje nyumba jhino mabhene, mwe Daude.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Peniya, aka Ichilahele ngabhabhujha kila mundo kajhake.<verse eid="1KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Nambo kwa bhando bhibhatamita ku miche jha Yuda tugha, Yeloboamo ngajhendilila kwalongocha.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ngantuma Adolamo, jwakibha jhukujhemelela mahengo ghu kuchokolekelwa, bhajhendelele aka Ichilahele nambo aka Ichilahele ngabhambula maghanga, ngabhankoma. Na Leoboamo ngahobhokila mutuka jhake jhihutwa na falache ngatilii ku Yeluchalemo. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Yene bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhalukana lukolo lwa Daude ade ngohe.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele pibhajhohina kubhehe Yeloboamu abhujhite kuhuma ku Michile ngabhankema pangongano pakongoloho, ngabhammeka kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele jhoha. Likapitii jhe likabila lenge lilikengima lukolo lwa Daude nambo likabila lya Yuda tugha.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulondole gwa Shemaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Ngongu 11:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Leoboamo kipinde chaika ku Yeluchalemo, ngabheka akakomana ngondo lake jhimo na elufo chemanine kuhumii mu likabila lya Yuda pamonga na likabila lya Benjamine kupala kubulana na aka Ichilahele kupala aukombole ulongoche gwake. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Nambo lilobhe lya Chapanga ngiliikila nnondole Shemaya kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />munnobholela Leoboamo mwana jwa Chelemane munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, pamonga na bhando bhoha bha likabila lya Yuda na likabila lya Benjamine pamonga na bhando bhange, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />Bhambo Chapanga alonge naha, “Mangajhenda jhe kwajhingilii akalongobhino mabhene bhando bhuku Ichilahele. Nkelebhuke kajhino mabhoha. Ku nhwalo lende lihumite kwango nenga.” Bhahe, bhoha ngabhannyoha Bhambo Chapanga na ngabhakelebhuka kajhabhe ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeloboamo inneka Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo ngachenga maha muche ghuku Shekemo ku ilambo ya itombe yuku Efulahimo ngatama kwenio. Peniya, ngajhenda kuchenga muche ghuku Penuele. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Peniya, Yeloboamo ngawacha umwojho kulonge, “Ngohe, ulongoche uhoto kubhujha kunyumba jha Daude. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Anda bhando bhamba nabhajhendelela kujhenda kupiya matambiko ghukukomelekeya kwenio ku Yeluchalemo, miojho jhabhe naing'alambukila munahota gwabhe Leoboamo ndi munahota nkolongwa gwabhe jhuku Yuda. Peniya, nabhangoma nenga nu kubhujha ku munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Bhahe, munahota nkolongwa ngalonge na bhando bhange, ngatendekeya inyagho ibhele ya litohe lya ng'ombi ya chaabo. Peniya, ngabhalobholila bhando, “Mangota mabhando bhuku Ichilahele inonwipe hake kwino kuhobhoka kujhenda ku Yeluchalemo. Dola, jhenje ndi ichapanga ino jhimmoita kuhumii kilambo chuku Michile! Makajhenda jhe kabhele ku Yeluchalemo kupiya matambiko ghu kukomelekeya kwenio.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Ngabheka kinyagho chimo ku muche ghuku Betele, na chenge kinyagho ngabhabheka ku muche ghuku Dane. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Peniya, Kilebhe chenje ngikibhila uhakaho, bhando ngabhajhenda kutale hake kwenio ku Betele nu ku Dane kujhinamila. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Helahela Yeloboamo ngachenga nyumba pikitombe pu kujhinamila, peniya, ngabhahagwila bhando bhanga Akalabhe kubhehe akapiya matambiko.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhajhinamii ku Betele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yeloboamo ngalaghila kubhehe unyagho kila lichiko lya kome nunhwano mwehe gwa nane, ubhaha unyagho ngita unyagho ghutendika ku Yuda. Ngapiya matambiko chehemo jhuku piikiya matambiko ku Betele ku inyagho ya matohe gha ng'ombi ghatendikiya gha chaabo, helahela ngabhabheka akapiya matambiko kila chehemo pipatondobhii pu kujhinamila kinyagho cha litohe lya ng'ombi jwakibha kwenio ku Betele. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Lichiko lyenie lya kome nu nhwano lya mwehe gwa nane, ndi lichiko lyahagwii jwene, ngapiya matambiko mu chehemo jhachengite kwenio ku Betele. Yene, ngatumbulicha unyagho kwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele, ngabhajhenda chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko jhela nu kututukiya ubane.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Lichiko limo, Yeloboamo akajhemite pahina na chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko kupala kututukiya ubane pa chehemo jhenio. Peniya, nnondole jwa Chapanga kuhumii ku Yuda ngaika kwenio ku Betele akatumitwe na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Bhahe, mundo jwenio ngachobhila kanonoho chehemo jhenio jhukupiikiya matambiko kukulonge, “Mwe ma chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko, mwe ma chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko, Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Nabhelukwa mwana mu lukolo lwa Daude liina lyake Yoseya. Jwenio nabhatola akapiya matambiko bhibhatumikii pamba kubhehe matambiko ghu kukomelekeya pamba chehemo jhitondobhile natiniya ihupa ya bhando bhibhawilingine panane jhino!’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Lichiko lele, mundo jwenio ngabhoha nginyililo kulonge, “Jhenje ndi nginyililo jhalongila Bhambo Chapanga, ‘Chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko naitilulwana na malihu ghighabhii panane jhake naghajhitika kutu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo pamanya malobhe ghala ghalongila ntumiche jwa Chapanga, ngatondobhiya lubhoko lwake nu kulonge, “Mukamule mundo jwenio!” Papa, lubhoko lwenio lwatondobhiya ngulujhoma chwaaa, akahotwii jhe kabhele kulukungutaya. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Na chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko jhenio ngaitulwikana nu malihu ngaghajhitika pahe, anda nginyililo jhela jhalongila nnondole jwa Chapanga ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo ngannobholila mundo jwa Chapanga kubhehe, “Chonde unnyope kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwino kwa malola ghango nenga, mbala anamiche lubhoko lwango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:6">Nnondole jwenio ngannyopita Bhambo Chapanga lubhoko lwa munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo ngulubhila njelembo.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Munahota nkolongwa ngannobholila nnondole kubhehe, “Chonde tujhenda kajhango makalye chakulya. Ne mbala nihupe hupo kunhwalo ghu ntehile.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Nambo nnondole jwa Chapanga jwenio ngalonge, “Ata makambii nucho jha ilebhe ino yoha nijhekete jhe kujhenda pamonga namwenga hilu nilye jhe amu kunywe pamba. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Kunhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ande kunaghalikiya kubhehe nangalye jhe hilu kunywe na hilu nangabhujhii jhe ku ndela jhinahikila pamba.” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Bhahe, mundo jwenio ngajhawila hilu abhujhii jhe mundela jhahikila ku Betele, nambo ngabhujha kundela jhenge.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnondole hokolo jhuku Betele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Kipinde chenie pakibha na nnondole jhumo kighogholo ku Betele. Yana yake ngijhenda kunchimulila tategwabhe nhwalo gwenio pamonga na ilebhe yoha itendike kwenio na nnondole jwenio jhuku Betele, na ngabhalonge malobhe ghalongila munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Tate gwabhe ngabhakonya, “Apetita ndela ghane pabhoka peniya?” Na yana mundo ngabhannangiya ndela jhapetite mundo jwa Chapanga jwenio jwahumila ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Jwenio ngabhailobholila yana yake, “Bhannenganikiye liponda.” Ngabhateila yene na jwenio ngahobhokela mu liponda lyenio, <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />ngankengamila mundo jwa Chapanga ngankolila atamite nhwina jha nkongo ghukemitwa mwalone. Jwenio ngankonya nnondole, “Bho, mwe ndi ma mundo bha Chapanga kuhumii ku Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Jwenio ngajhangwila, “Ena! Ndi nenga.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Bhahe, nnondole kighogholo ngajhendilila kulonge, “Tijha kajhango makalye chakulya.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Nambo mundo jwa Chapanga jhola ngalonge, “Ne nihoto jhe kubhujha na mwe amu kulye chakulya hilu kunywe kilebhe chochoha pamba, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ande kunaghalikiya nangalye jhe chakulya amu kunywe kilebhe chochoha chehemo jhenje na hilu nangabhujha jhe ku ndela jhinhikilagha.”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Nnondole kighogholo jwenio jhuku Betele, ngajhangwila kukulonge, “Nenga hele nalondole jwa Chapanga ngita mwenga, kabhele Bhambo Chapanga andehi kunduma kupete ntumiche jhukunane kwa Chapanga kulonge, ‘Hike kuntola mwenga tujhende kajhango kupala makalyeghe nu kunywegha.’ ” Nambo nnondole kighogholo jwenio akibha nhwange tugha.<verse eid="1KI 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Peniya, nnondole jwenio ngabhujha pamonga na kighogholo jwenio, ngalye chakulya nu kunywe mache mu nyumba jha nnondole jhola kighogholo. <verse eid="1KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Kipinde chalila, lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalihika kwa nnondole kighogholo jwamujhicha nnondole jwa Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />nu ngannobholila jwenio nnondole jhuku Yuda, “Bhambo Chapanga lilonge naha, Mwenga mukalijhokanikii jhe na mijhokanikii jhe mihilo jhapila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jhannaghalikiye. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Nambo mwenga mmujhite kulye chakulya nu kunywe mache pamba punnaghilwa mangalye jhe hilu kunywe mache, ku nhwalo gwenio ntuhe gwino uchikwa jhe ku mambe jha akahoko bhino.”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Bhahe, mundo jwa Chapanga jhuku Yuda pajhomolila kulyegha, jhola nnondole kighogholo ngalenganikiya liponda kunhwalo jha jwenio, na jwenio ngajhawila. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Pakibha akajhenda ngakongina na liimba ngilinkoma na ntuhe gwake ngubhe papa pandela, liponda lyake pamonga na liimba ngabhabhila bhajhemite paupele jha ntuhe. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Bhando bhibhapeta peniya nu kubhona ntuhe gwenio pandela, ni liimba lijhemite pahina, ngabhajhenda kwatama nnondole jwenio kunchimulila ghibhaghawene.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Nnondole jwenio pajhoha gheniya ngamanya kubhehe, “Jwenio ndi jwajho mundo jwa Chapanga jwakana kukengama mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga! Na yene Bhambo Chapanga alitumite liimba linkachulane nu kunkoma ngita chalongila.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Nnondole kighogholo jhola ngailobholila yana mundo, “Umbanganikiye liponda.” Na bheniya ngabhannenganikiya. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Kighogholo jwenio ngajhenda ngaukole ntuhe gwa nnondole jwenio, pahina lijhemite liimba pamonga ni liponda. Liimba lyenio lilii jhe ntuhe gwenio, hilu kulikwachulana liponda. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Peniya, kighogholo jwenio ngautola ntuhe gwa mundo jwa Chapanga, ngaubheka panane jha liponda lyake na ngauleta, ngalelita malelo ghake nu kunchika. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Bhahe, nganchika ku mambe jhake, jwenio pamonga na yanamundo ngabhalelita malelo gheniya kulonge, mwe malongo bhito tunkole kiya! <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Kuhumii pu kunchika malelo gheniya nnondole kighogholo jwenio ngailobholila yanamundo, “Nenga anda nyomwike, unjikila mumambe jhenjeno pamonga na mundo jwa Chapanga, mmeka ihupa yango pahina na ihupa ya mundo jwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Ilebhe yoha ghalongila Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo gwa chehemo jhi kupiikiya matambiko ghuku Betele na chehemo yoha patondobhahu kumuche ghuku Samaliya, chakaka ipakulenganila.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubhoho gwa Yeloboamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Ata yene, munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo jhuku Ichilahele akalekite jhe ubhoho gwake, ngajhendilila kabhele kwahaghuu bhando akabhoho kubhehe akapiya matambiko, bhakantumikile chehemo jhitondobhile jhibhachenga. Ngammeka mpiya litambiko kila mundo jwampalita. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Uhakaho gwenio ngutenda lukolo lwa Yeloboamo kukomelekelwa nu kuputwa pulutu pannema.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa mwana jwa Yeloboamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Kipinde chenie, Abiya mwana jwa munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo, atehila kulwalwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yeloboamo ngannobholila nhwanamundo, “Nkopokeya kubhehe mundo jhonge kupala mangamanyikana kubhehe mahana bha munahota nkolongwa. Peniya, nnyende ku Shilo kwatama nnondole Ahiya jhola jwalongila kubhehe nenga mbakubhe nanahota nkolongwa jwaku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Mupeleke mabumunda kome pamonga na maandache na chupa chimo cha bhuche, jwenio nannobholela chikinkolile mwana gwito.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Peniya, aana bha Yeloboamo ngabhoka, ngajhenda ku Shilo kajhake Ahiya. Kipinde chenio, Ahiya miho ghake ghakojhekine kunhwalo gwa ughohe. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga akibha anobholii Ahiya kubhehe aana bha Yeloboamo bhitenda kuhika kukonyekeya ku nhwalo ghu kulwalwa kwa mwanamundo munalome. Bhambo Chapanga ngampila majhango ghukunnyanga nhwana gwa Yeloboamo kipinde chapakuhika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:5">Nhwana gwa Yeloboamo pahika ngakopokeya jwenio mundo jhonge tugha. <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Kipinde chahikagha Ahiya ngajhoha kihindo pannyango ngalonge, “Jhingila nkate mone mwe maana bha Yeloboamo, kilebhe ghane mikitehi kubhehe jhonge mundo tugha? Ngwete nhwalo ghukunnobhela gwambone ndeka kwino!” <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Nnyende makannobholele Yeloboamo kubhehe, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwaka Ichilahele, ilonge naha, ‘Nikanhagwii panakate jha bhando bhuku Ichilahele nukummeka mme makilongoche bha bhando bhango aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Nganiukenjwila ulongoche kubhoke ku kibheluko cha Daude, nginimpila mwenga. Nambo mwenga mmii tela jhe na ntumiche jwango Daude, jwakibha alenganikiya maha mihilo jhango na atehila ghala tugha ghinninaghalikiya nu kungema kwa mwojho gwake ghoha. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Mwenga ntehi mabhoho twe kuliku akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bhibhalongolile. Mwe unganite nenga na undehi njimwe kwa kukitengenechela ichapanga yenge yu kuyana nu kuijhinamila. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Kunhwalo gwa ilebhe yenio mbakuleta malwalo mu nyumba jha Yeloboamo. Kila mwana munalome jhukujhomolela jwa lukolo lwa Yeloboamo naninkoma mu Ichilahele jhoha, abha mmanda jwake amu jwangabhe mmanda. Nanakomelekeya kwa mwotu bhando bha lukolo lwa Yeloboamo ngita mundo chatiniya mabule gha inyama ade ghamung'uka njwenjwe. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Mundo jhojhoha jwa lukolo lwa Yeloboamo, jwapa kujhomwoka pamuche, nalegwa na ghimbwa na jwapala kujhomwoke kung'onda nalegwa ni ijhune. Ne Bhambo Chapanga ndi nongile gheniya.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ahiya ngannobholila aana bha Yeloboamo, “Ajha, nnyinuke nnyende kajhino. Ndi kipinde tugha pumpakuhika kubomane mwana gwino najhomwoka. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, nabhahika kulela malelo nu kunchika. Jwenio ndo kanjika pakate jha mu lukolo lwa Yeloboamo jwapakuchikwa, nhwalo jwenio ndi jwanhalaliche Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Bhambo Chapanga nanyinula mundo jhonge kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhonge jhuku Ichilahele, jwapa kukiputilii okwe lukolo lwa Yeloboamo. Ata ngohe, kilebhe chenio kitumbwile kupitila <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Bhambo Chapanga abhakwachwapula bhando bhuku Ichilahele na bheniya nabhanyukanyuka ngita matete ghuku kuloche. Na apakwatupula mu kilambo china kuhalala chabhampii akahoko bhabhe na kwapechengana kwiye jhi lukemba lwa Efulate, nhwalo bhantehi Bhambo Chapanga abha nilindoghondogho kukutendekeya Ashela, kichapanga mwikeghe. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Bhambo Chapanga nabhaleka aka Ichilahele ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho ghatei Yeloboamo, na ngabhajhambukiya aka Ichilahele bhatende.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Peniya, aana bha Yeloboamo ngabhabhoka, na ngajhenda kajhake ku muche ghuku Tiliza. Kipinde tugha pibhahika kikola mino cha nnyango, mwana gwake ngajhomwika. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhalelita malelo nu kunchika ngita Bhambo Chapanga chabhalobholila kupete nnondole Ahiya.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Yeloboamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Ilebhe henge yatenda Yeloboamo na ngondo yabuline nu ulongoche ghu kinahota nkolongwa gwake, ghajhandikwe Mukitabo cha Kombokela chuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yeloboamo ngalongwicha ku kipinde cha yaka ichiline niibhele, peniya ngajhomwika, na mwana mundo Nadabo ngalongwicha chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leoboamo munahota nkolongwa jwaku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2 Ngongu 11:5-12:15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Leoboamo mwana jwa Chelemane pahikicha yaka makome ncheche na limo ngabhila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda. Ngailongwicha Yuda kuhumii Yeluchalemo yaka kome na chaba, muche gwauhagwila Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe chehemo jhikujhinamilwa pakate jha miche jhoha jha makabila ghaka Ichilahele. Majhemundo akemitwa Naama, jwa likabila lya Amone.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Bhando bhuku Yuda ngabhantende ubhoho Bhambo Chapanga na ngabhantenda abhe nililaka nhwalo gwa ubhoho gwabhe ndiii kupeta ubhoho ghubhatehila akahokomundo. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Kunhwalo bhakatendikii chehemo jhukujhinamila, na ngabhajhemeka heke ya maghanga pamonga ni inyagho ya ichapanga mwikeghe Ashela, chehemo pikitombe kitandamaho pamonga na nhwina jhi mikongo mikolongwa jhibhii na mahamba. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Kabhele mu kilambo chuku Yuda, mukibha na akanalome bhibhagholokina bhene kwa bhene kunhwalo gwa kujhinamila inyagho yabhe. Ilebhe yenio iteilwa na bhando ilambo henge, Bhambo Chapanga ngaghabhenga kabula aka Ichilahele bhanahika jhe ku kilambo chuku Kaanane.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Chaka chu nhwano chu kulongocha gwa Leoboamo, munahota nkolongwa shishake jhuku Michile, ngaujhingila muche ghuku Yeluchalaemo. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Ngatola ilebhe yoha ibhekitwe mu kihukilo cha Nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga na mu kihukilo cha nyumba jha kinahota kikolongwa. Ngatola kila kilebhe na ikopa yoha ya chaabo yatendikiya Chelemane. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Yene, munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ngatendekiya ikopa ya shaba na kwape akalonda bhu ulonda gwa litangala lya nyumba jhi kinahota. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Kila kipinde munahota nkolongwa pajhenda ku Nyumba jha Chapanga, akalonda bhatehila kughegha ikopa yenio kujhenda nayo kwenio, nu kubhujha najho mu chumba chu ulonda.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Itendwa yenge yu munahota nkolongwa Leoboamo ijhandikwe Mukitabo cha Kombokela ya Akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Machiko ghoha ngapabhila na ngondo pakate jha Yeloboamo pamonga na Leoboamo. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Kujhomolela kwa gheniya ghoha, Leoboamo ngajhomwika nu ngabhanchika mu mambe jha akahokomundo ku muche gwa Daude. Na majhemundo akemitwa Naama, kuhumii ku Amone. Abiyamo mwanamundo ngalongwicha chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Abiya ilongocha ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Ngongu 13:1-14:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Abiya ngatumbwila kulongocha ku Yuda chaka cha kome na nane cha ulongoche gwa Yeloboamo, mwana jwa Nebate. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Ngalongwicha ku Yuda kwa kipinde cha yaka itato, kuhumii kwenio ku Yeluchalemo. Majhemundo akemitwa Maaka, bite Abusolomo. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Abiya ngatenda uhakaho ghogholaghola gwatehila tatemundo, na akibha ahobholika jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwake ngita chakibha ahobholika hokomundo Daude. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Ata yene, kunhwalo gwa Daude, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwake ngampila Abiya mwana, kulongocha chehemo jha tatemundo mu Yeluchalemo, akatame ku Yeluchalemo nu kukibheka kilambo chenie kibhehe nganganga. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Bhambo Chapanga ngatenda yene, nhwalo Daude akatenda ghambone kwa Bhambo Chapanga na akanite jhe mihilo jhojhoha jhalaghila Bhambo Chapanga, machiko ghoha gha ughome gwake. Nambo tu kunhwalo gwa Uliya, mundo jhuku Hite. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kukibha na ngondo pakate jha Leoboamo na Yeloboamo kipinde choha Abiya pakibha ghome. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Kila kilebhe chatehila Abiya kikajhandikwe Mu kitabo cha Kombokela ya akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Yuda. Kukibha na ngondo pakate jha Abiya na Yeloboamo.<verse eid="1KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiya ngajhomwika na ngabhanchika kumambe jha ku muche gwa Daude, na Asa mwana mundo, ngalongwicha chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asa ilongocha ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2 Ngongu 15:16-16:6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Muchaka cha makome mabhele chu ulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Yeloboamo jhuku Ichilahele, Asa ngatumbu kulongocha kwenio ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Ngalongwicha kipinde cha yaka makome ncheche na limo. Mbujhamundo akemitwa Maaka, bite Abusolamo. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Munahota nkolongwa Asa ngatenda ghambone kwa Bhambo Chapanga ngita chatenda hokomundo Daude. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Ngabhabhenga mu kilambo akanalome bhibhagholokina bhene kwa bhene na kuibhoha inyagho yela ibhatenginicha akahokomundo. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Ngampoka mbujhamundo Maaka mu ulongoche ghukubhehe linyongolo, kunhwalo akatendekii kinyagho cha Ashela, kichapanga mwikeghe na ngakajwilina kichapanga chenie nu kutiniya mwotu kululambo luku Kedulone. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Ata yene, atilulinii jhe chehemo pipajhinwike pu kujhinamila ichapanga, kwenio ku kitombe, nambo jwene ngajhendelela kuhobholeka kwa Bhambo Chapanga mu ughome gwake gwoha. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Ngabhujhicha ilebhe yoha ikalenganikilwe kunhwalo gwa lihengo lya Chapanga na tatemundo kubhehe jwa nyahinyahi Munyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga pamonga na ilebhe yake jwene, itenganichwe kwa madine gha feza na chaabo na henge ilebhe.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Asa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, na Baasha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, bhakibha na ngondo pakate jhabhe, machiko ghoha ghu ulongoche gwabhe. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baasha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, ngakijhingilila kilambo chuku Yuda nu kuchenga lipamanda ku muche ghuku Lama, kupala kwaibhilila bhando bhangapeta jhe mu kilambo chuku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Asa ngatola madine gha feza na chaabo mu kihukilo mu Nyumba jha Chapanga pamonga na maghanga gha nyumba jha kinahota kikolongwa. Ngabhapila akatumiche bhake na kwatuma bhapeleke kwa Benihadade mwana jwa Tabilimone, nchokolo jwa Hezione, munahota nkolongwa jwakibha atamita kwenio Damachiko, akilongela, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tutende majheketelano pakate jhino na nenga ngita chabhatehila akatate bhito na nimpe madine gha feza na chaabo. Nnyende makatweku ulongo gwino pakate jhino na Baasha, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele kupala abhoke mu kilambo chango.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Peniya, munahota Benehadade ngajheketila nhwalo gwa munahota nkolongwa Asa jhuku Yuda ngapelika ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo bhake nu kujhenda kujhingilila miche jhuku Ichilahele. Peniya, ngaitola kwa makakala miche jha Iyone na Dane na Abele Bete Maaka, pahina na lilabha lya Galilaya pamonga na chehemo jha Nafutale. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Munahota nkolongwa Baasha pajhoha kujhingililwa kwenio, ngakotoka kuchenga lipamanda lya muche ghuku Lama, na ngabhujha kutama ku Tiliza.<verse eid="1KI 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Asa ngatangicha kwa bhando bhoha bhuku Yuda changanneka mundo hilu jhumo kupala bhabhoye maghanga ghoha na mbau pamonga na ilebhe yoha, Baasha yatumila kuchenge ku Lama. Asa ngatumila ilebhe yenio kuchenga muche gwa ku Geba ghubhii mu kilambo chuku Benjamine nu ku Misipa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Itendwa yoha ya munahota nkolongwa Asa ghajhandikwe Mukitabo cha Kombokela ya Akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Yuda. Nambo Asa paghogholwika ngabhila nuulwalo gwa makongono. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Asa ngajhomwika na ngabhanchika ku mambe jha akanahota akakolongwa ku muche gwa Daude, na mwana mundo Yehoshafate ngalongwicha pwache jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadabo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Piika chaka chubhele mulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Asa kwenio ku Yuda, Nadabo mwana jwa Yeloboamo ngatumbu kulongocha ku Ichilahele na ngalongwicha kwa yaka ibhele. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabo ngatenda ubhoho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ngita chateila tatemundo chabhatenda aka Ichilahele bhatende ubhoho.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwana jwa Ahiya, jwa likabila lya Ichakale, ngabheka ntambo ghukuntegha Nadabo, kipinde Nadabo akakomana ngondo bhake pibhakilenganikiya kuujhingilila Gibetone liboma lyaka Filichite, Baasha nganyingilila Nadabo na ngankoma. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasha ngankoma Nadabo mu chaka chu utato chulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Asa, jhuku Yuda, na Baasha ngabhila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, chehemo jha Nadabo. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Kipinde tu Baasha patumbwila kulongocha ngabhakoma bhando bhoha bhi lukolo lwa Yeloboamo, hilu annekitii jhe mundo hilu jhumo kubhehe ghome, yene, ilenganila na ghalongila Bhambo Chapanga kupete nnondole jwake Ahiya jhuku Shilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Kilebhe chenie kitendika nhwalo Yeloboamo akatei uhakaho ghugwatenda aka Ichilahele bhetende uhakaho helahela, yene, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele ngabhayomila.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Itendwa ya Nadabo na ilebhe henge yoha yateila, ghakajhandikwe Mukitabo cha Kombokela ya akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Munahota nkolongwa Asa jwaku Yuda na munahota nkolongwa Baasha jhuku Ichilahele, bhakibha mu ngondo machiko ghabhe ghoha pibhakibha mu kulongocha kwabhe.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Piika yaka itato yu longoche gwa Asa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, Baasha mwana jwa Ahiya, ngatumbu kulongocha ku Ichilahele akahumila ku Tiliza. Ngalongwicha ku kipinde cha yaka makome mabhele na ncheche. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Munahota nkolongwa Baasha ngatenda uhakaho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngatenda ghaghala ghala ghateila Yeloboamo, lyatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatende uhakaho.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngiliikila Yehu, mwana jwa Hanane kunhwalo jha Baasha kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Mwenga ma Baasha makibha mamundo mangamanyikana, ne nganimpila ulongoche malongoche bhando bhango ku Ichilahele, mwe ntehi uhakaho ghogholaghola gwatenda Yeloboamo na matehi bhando bhango bhatende uhakaho. Uhakaho gwabhe undehi mme nililaka. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Deleno, mbala kunkomelekeya mwenga na bhando bhu lukolo lwino bhoha, ngita chindehila kwa Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nebate. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Nnongo gwino jhojhoha jwapa kujhomoke pabomane, nalegwa na ghimbwa na nnongo gwino jhojhoha jwapa kujhomoke ku mighonda, nahonyolelwa ni ijhune yu kunane.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Itendwa henge ya Baasha ni ilebhe yake imakakala ghakajhandikwe mu kitabo cha Kombokela ya Akanahota Akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Yene, Baasha ngajhomwika ngabhanchika kwenio ku Tiliza. Ela mwanamundo ngalongwicha pwache jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Kabhele, lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngiliikilila nnondole Yehu, mwana jwa Hanane panane jha Baasha pamonga na akalongo mundo, ku nhwalo ghu ubhoho ghubhantendila Bhambo Chapanga. Yene, Baasha ngantenda Bhambo Chapanga ahyome kuitendwa yake, na ngabhakomalikiya akalongo mundo ngita pibhakomilikilwa akalongo mundo Yeloboamo.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela ilongocha ku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Piika chaka cha makome mabhele na chita kulongocha kwa Asa munahato nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, Ela mwana jwa Baasha, ngatumbu kulongocha kwenio ku Ichilahele, kuhumii ku Tiliza, na ngalongwicha ku kipinde cha yaka ibhele. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Ntumiche jwake jhumo jwakemitwa Zimolii jwakibha kilongoche jwa nucho kikunde cha mutuka jhihutwa na falache ngantendela nginyika munahaota nkolongwa Ela. Lichiko limo, munahota nkolongwa Ela pakibha ku Tiliza, kajhake Alisa jwakibha ajhemilila nyumba ya kinahota nkolongwa, nganywila ughembe ngalobhila titilii. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimolii ngajhingii unyumba ngambula nu kunkoma Ela na ngakitenda kubhehe munahota nkolongwa chehemo jhake. Kilebhe chenie kitendika chaka chi makome mabhele na chaba chu ulongoche gwa Asa, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Kipinde tugha Zimolii patumbwila kulongocha, Zimili ngabhakoma kinyongolo choha cha Baasha, kila nnongo amu nkoche munalome jwa Baasha, bhoha ngabhakoma. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Yene, Zimili ngakomilikiya lukolo lwoha lwa Baasha, tela na lilobhe lyalongila Bhambo Chapanga kupete nnondole Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Ku nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwatenda Baasha na mwana mundo Ela, bheniya ngabhatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatende uhakaho ghu kujhinamii ichapanga yabhe, ngaintenda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele ayome hake. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Itendwa henge ya munahota nkolongwa Ela na ghoha ghateila mulongoche gwake, ghajhandikwe Mu kitabo cha Kombokela ya Akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimli ilongocha ku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Piika chaka cha makome mabhele na chaba mulongoche gwa Asa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, Zimoli ngabhila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, ahumila ku Tiliza, na jwenio ngalongwicha kwa machiko chaba tugha. Akakomana ngondo ngabhabheka kighono pahina na Gibetone mu kilambo cha aka Filichite. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Kipinde aka Ichilahele pibhakibha mu kighono, pibhang'amwila Zimolii atehi nginyika jhukupala kunkoma munahota nkolongwa Ela, ngabhantangicha Omile nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo gwabhe kubhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, lichiko lele. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Omile pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake ngabhabhoka ku Gibetone, nu kujhenda kuijhingilila muche ghuku Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimolii palola kubhehe muche upukilwe kwa makakala, ngajhingii mu nyumba jhi kinahota na ngaijhocha mwotu na jwenie ngawelela momo. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Kilebhe chenie litendika kunhwalo gwa uhakaho yateila Zimili palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ku kunnyigha Yeloboamo jwatehila uhakaho na kwatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatende uhakaho. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Itendwa henge ya Zimolii nu kughaluka kwake ikajhandikwe Mukitabo cha Kombokela ya akanahota Akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omile ilongocha ku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele kipinde chenie ngibhapechingina ikunde ibhele, kikunde chimo ngikimpala Tibine mwana jwa Ginate kubhehe munahota nkolongwa, na kikunde chenge ngikimpala Omile abhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Nambo kikunde chikinkengima Omile kikibha na makakala kupeta bhibhankengima Tibine. Yene, Tibine ngajhomwika na Omile ngabhila munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Omile ngatumbwila kulongocha chaka cha makome matato na limo chu longoche gwa Asa, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda na ngalongwicha yaka kome niibhele, na yaka chita ngalongwicha kwenio ku Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Pughapetita gheniya, Omile ngahemila kitombe cha Samaliya kwa mundo jhumo jwakemitwa Shemele ku ipande elufo chita ya madine gha feza, na ngachenge majhumba panane jhi kitombe chenie. Ngautina liina lya Samaliya, kunhwalo jha Shemele, nkolo kitombe chenio, kuhumii makacho.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Nambo Omile ngatenda mabhoho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele, kupeta bhoha bhibhannongolile. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Nhwalo akannyigha Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nebate, ngantenda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele achimwe, ku kwatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatende uhakaho ku kuijhinamila inyagho. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Itendwa henge ya munahota nkolongwa Omile na makakala ghake ghajhandikwe mukitabo cha Kombokela ya Akanahota Akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Peniya, Omile ngajhomwika na ngabhanchika ku Samaliya. Na mwana mundo Ahabo, ngalongwicha chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabo ilongocha ku Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Piika chaka cha makome matato na nane ghu ulongoche gwa Asa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, Ahabo mwana jwa omile, ngatumbwila kulongocha ku Ichilahele. Ngalongwicha ku Samaliya kwa yaka makome mabhele ni mabhele <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabo mwana gwa Omili ngatenda uhakaho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kupeta akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bhibhalongolile. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Kuchocha kwa gheniya, nganyigha Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nebate, helahela Ahabo ngantolila mwikeghe jwakemitwa Yezebele mwana jwa Etebaale, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Sidone, na ngatumbwila kuntumikila nu kunnyinamila kichapanga Baale. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Ngabhanchenge nyumba kichapanga Baale kwenio ku Samaliya, na nkate jhake ngabhantendekeya chehemo jhu kupiikiya matambiko. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Helahela ngatendekeya kinyagho cha Ashela, kichapanga mwikeghe. Ahabo ngatenda mabhoho twe ghakuntenda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele ayome, kupeta akanahota akakolongwa bhoha bhuku Ichilahele bhibhannongolile. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Kipinde chulongoche gwake Ahabo, Hele kuhumii ku Betele, ngachenga kabhele muche ghuku Yeliko. Nambo pakibha achengita nchinge gwa muche ghuku Yeliko, mwana mundo jwa litibho ngajhomwika, helahela pachengelila matangala gha muche, mwana mundo Segubo ngajhomwika, ghanga ghapetila kupete lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga kupete Yochuwa, mwana jwa Nune.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Eliya ibhilikiya hula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Peniya, Eliya jhu kuchenda jhuku Tishibe, chikibhii kwenio ku Gileade ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa Ahabo kubhehe, “Ne, napii ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele jhunintumikii kubhehe, napabhe jhe na mangame hilu hula kwa yaka henge ade pumbakulonge nenga.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Eliya, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Mmoke chehemo jhenje nnyende upande ghulihumii lyobha mikakihiye mu kipela cha Kelite, chikibhii upande ghulihumii lyobha jhu lukemba Yoludane. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Kwenio nampata mache ghu kunywe mu kipela chenio. Kabhele nighalaghalikii makongolo ghannete chakulya.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Peniya, Eliya ngaijhoha mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhenda kutama kukipela cha Kelite chikibhii upande ghulihumii lyobha jhu lukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Makongolo ngaghannetii libumunda na nyama, lukela na kimiye na nganywe mache kubhoke mu kipela chenie. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Nambo kuhumii pikipinde tugha kipela chenio ngikijhoma chwaa, nhwalo hula ikomite jhe pi kilambo.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya iyokecha mwana jwa nawela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Peniya, lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngiliikilila Eliya kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Mmoke nnyende ku muche ghu ku Seleputa, pahina mu kilambo chuku Sidone, makatama kwenio. Ninnaghalikiye mwikeghe jhumo nahwela, nampela chakulya kwenio.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Yene, Eliya ngabhoka ngajhenda ku Seleputa. Paika pa litangala likolongwa lya muche, ngankole mwikeghe jhumo nahwela akatina hanjo. Eliya ngankema mwikeghe jwenio nu kunnobholela, “Chonde, nijhopa mache nyweghe.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Nawela jwenio ngajhenda kuteka mache, Eliya ngannobholila, “Chonde, unnete ni libumunda.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Mwikeghe jwenio ngalonge, “Ne, nilapii ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jwabhii ghome, ngwetii jhe libumunda hilu lyandina, chingwete lukohe lumo tugha lwa uhembe munkambo pamonga na mahuta ghandina mu chupa, chinhikila pamba kutina hanjo, mujhe ukajha nakateleke chakulya cheneche nakalye nenga pamonga na yanango, peniya, tuweghe.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya ngannobholila, “Mangapwelela jhe. Nnyende makatende ngita chinnongile. Nambo makatumbula kundeleke ote nenga kabumunda kandina kwa uhembe ghunkwete, makanetela na peniya mukiteleke mwenga na mwana gwino. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Mana Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jhuku Ichilahele ilonge, ‘Uhembe ghubhii munkambo nupungohe jhe hilu mahuta mu chupa ghipongo jhe, ade nenga Bhambo Chapanga pimbakuleta hula mu kilambo.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Bhahe, nawela jwenio ngatenda ngita Eliya channobholile, nu kuhumii lichiko lyenio nawela jwenio pamonga na akalongo mundo bhakapongokilwe jhe na chakulya kwa kipinde cha machiko twe. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Uhembe munkambo upongwika jhe hilu mahuta muchupa ghapongwika jhe tela tu ni lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga channobholila Eliya alonge.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Pughapetita gheniya, mwana jwa nkolo nyumba jhenie ngalwalita, ulwalo gwenio ngiujhendilila ade mwana jwenio ngajhomwika. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Nawela jwenio ngankonya Eliya, “Mwe mundo jwa Chapanga, tukomanila kilebhe ghane mindende naha? Bho, mwenga nhikila kungombocha uhakaho gwango nu kutenda mwanango kujhomwoka?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya ngannyangwila, “Umbe pamba mwana jwenio.” Peniya, Eliya ngantola mwana jwenio mu mabhoko gha majhe mundo, ngajhenda nako ku chumbe chu kunane chatamita, ngang'oneka pikindanda. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Peniya, ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, “Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, bho, malelo kwa mwikeghe jhonjo nawela jhunitama kajhake, kwa kuntenda mwana mundo ajhomoke?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Peniya, Eliya ngagholoka panane jha mwana jwenio mala patato, na ngannyopa Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, “Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, mmujhichile mwana ojho ughome gwake!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngajhoha kujhopa kwake Eliya, mwana ngayokita.<verse eid="1KI 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya nganhulwiya pahe mwana jwenio kuhumii ku chumbe cha kunane, na ngampila majhemundo na kunnobhole, “Dola, mwana gwino ojho, abhii ghome.”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Yene, mwikeghe jwenio ngannobholila Eliya, “Ngohe, manye kubhehe mwenga ndi ma mundo bha Bhambo Chapanga, na malobhe gha Bhambo Chapanga ghighapita munnomo gwino ndi chakaka.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Eliya itaungana na akalondole bha Baale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Kuhumii pa machiko ghamahele, mu chaka cha utato cha lulange, lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalinhikila Eliya kulonge, “Nnyende makakongane na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo, mbakukomecha hula pa kilambo.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Yene, Eliya ngajhenda kukongana na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Kipinde chenio, pakibha na njala hake mu kilambo chuku Samaliya.<verse eid="1KI 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Bhahe, Ahabo ngankemita Obadiya, kilongoche jwa nyumba jha munahota nkolongwa. Obadiya akibha mundo jwa Bhambo Chapanga hake. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Kipinde Yezebele pabhakomita akalondole bha Chapanga, Obadiya ngabhatola akalondole miya jhimo na kwahiya, mu ibhogha ibhele ya akalondole makome nhwano makome nhwano mu kila linkwembe, na kwapelekela yakulya pamonga na mache. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Peniya, Ahabo ngannobholila Obadiya, “Nnyende makapalae muyembwe na mwipela, pange natupata manyahe ghukwalichikii falache pamonga na maponda ghito kupala ingawe jhe hilu tupalwa jhe kuikoma inyama ito.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Bhahe, ngibhapechengina mu kilambo choha kupala kujhenda kupalaha manyahe, Ahabo ngajhenda upande gwake na Obadiya upande ghonge.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadiya pakibha undela, papatu ngakongina na Eliya, obadiya pammanya kubhehe ojho Eliya ngajhinama pahe kulonge, “Bho, Chakaka ndi mwenga manahota bhango ma Eliya?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya ngajhangwila, “Ndi nenga na Eliya. Nnyende makalobholele Ahabo munahota gwino kubhehe ne mmi pamba.”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadiya ngalonge, “Ne nnemwiye kilebhe ghane ade umeke mu kiholo chukukomwa na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Ninnapii kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jwabhii ghome, bhando bhoha mu kilambo bhimpalaha mwenga. Kila kilambo amu unahota nkolongwa ghoghoha akantumi jhe mundo kumpalaha. Ahabo ngampala munahota nkolongwa jwenio kulapila kubhehe chakaka mmi jhe kwenio. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Ngohe, mwenga mimpala ne nakalonge kubhehe Eliya mmii pamba! <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Manyii jhe chehemo papakumpeleka kihuke jwa Bhambo pumbala kunneka pamba. Anda nyahwile nu kunnobholela Ahabo kubhehe mmi pamba na jwenio ankolii jhe, nangoma nenga. Nenga natumiche bhino ninyinamii Bhambo Chapanga kuhumii ungombo gwango. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Bho, mwe nnyohine jhe Yezebele pakibha akakoma akalondole bha Bhambo Chapanga? Bho, nenga jhe jwanahita akalondole miya jhimo, makome nhwano mu kila nkwembe na kwapelekela yakulya pamonga na mache? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Ngohe, mwe unnobhole nyende nikannobholele munahota kubhehe mwe Eliya mmii pamba, Ahabo nandenda kungoma.”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya ngalonge, “Ne, napii kwa Bhambo Chapanga jhuna makakala jhunintumikii kubhehe deleno, mba kukilangiya nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa Ahabo.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Yene, Obadiya ngajhenda ku munahota nkolongwa Ahabo nu kunnobholela. Na Ahabo ngajhenda kukongana nako Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Kipinde chakongina na Eliya, Ahabo ngannobholila Eliya, “Bho, mwe ndi jhumaletela malagho Akaichilahele?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya ngajhangwila, “Ojwaleta malagho ku Ichilahele ne jhe, nambo mwenga na akalongo bha atate gwino. Mangota mwe ntehi kuipucha mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga nu kuntumikii ichapanga Baale. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Deleno, makeme bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele nnonge jhango, okwe kukitombe chuku Kalimele. Helahela makeme akalondole bha kichapanga Baale miya ncheche na amuchine pamonga na milondole miya ncheche bha Ashela, kichapanga mwikeghe jwalyegha pa kachangwale pa linyongolo Yezebele.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Bhahe, Ahabo ngatuma lilobhe mu Ichilahele jhoha na kwakonganicha akalondole bhoha bha Baale kwenio ku kitombe chuku Kalimele. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Eliya ngabhabhandikila bhando bheniya ngalonge, “Nunholela umwojho nu kupetupetuka ade ligha? Anda Bhambo Chapanga ndi Chapanga, bhahe, munkengamile jwenio, na anda ibhii Baale ndi Chapanga, bhahe, munkengamila jwenio.” Nambo bhando bheniya bhakanyangwii jhe kilebhe. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Peniya, Eliya ngabhalobholila bhando, “Ne ndo kajhika nannondole bha Bhambo Chapanga jwahighilile, nambo Baale bhabhii akalondole miya ncheche na amuchine. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Ajha! Nnetangane ng'ombi ya nkambako ibhele, akalondole bha Baale bhakahaghula ng'ombi jhumo bhanchinja nu kuhanjana ipande nu kubheka panane jha hanjo panga mwotu. Nanenga nanjinja ng'ombi jhonge nu kuhanjana ipande nu kubheka panane pa hanjo panga mwotu. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Peniya, angota akalondole bha Baale bhannyopa kichapanga jwabhe, na nenga naninyopa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwapakujhangula kukuleta mwotu jwenio ndi Chapanga jwa kwele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Peniya, nchambe gwa bhando ngulonge, “Ena, limulonge lyambone.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Bhahe, Eliya ngabhalobholela akalondole bha Baale, “Mangotamwe mmi mamahele, ntumbule. Nhwaghulane ng'ombi jhumo jwa nkambako munnenganikiya nukunnyopa kichapanga chino, nambo mangachonja jhe mwotu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Akalondole bheniya ngabhannenganikiya ng'ombi jwabhe jhubhanhwagwile, ngabhatumbuu kunnyopa kichapanga Baale kutumbulii lukela ade lyobha palototohe, kongo bhikilongela kanonoho kulonge, “Mwe ma Baale mutujhangule!” Nambo ikapiti jhe lilobhe hilu abhii jhe jwabhajhangwile! Ndi pibhajhendilila kuhombahomba na kukina kutindii chehemo jha kupiikiya matambiko jhibhachengite.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Piika chaa chita, Eliya ngatumbuu kwatende chanake kulonge, “Nnyopa kukutondobheya lilobhe! Nhwalo jwenio kichapanga pange atehi kukiibhuka amu abhii kucholo amu abhii umwanja. Iwechekana abhii lughono lyoo, munyimuye!” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Akalondole bheniya ngibhachobhela hake ngibhikilemba mapanga ghighatema kone na kone na ihembe yabhe ngita chibhayobhalile ade ngindonywika miyahe muyegha jhoha. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Ngabhajhendilila kuchobhela nu kutenda ngita bhinang'oloka ade kimiye, kipinde chukupiya matambiko, nambo akibha jhe jwabhajhangwii hilu kwajhokanikiya.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Peniya, Eliya ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha, “Nhweghelele pamba.” Bheniya ngibhabhandikila. Eliya ngatumbu kutendekeya kabhele chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko gha Bhambo Chapanga, lilikibha litilulinwe. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya, ngatola maghanga kome na mabhele, kila limo ku nhwalo gwa kila likabila lya yana ya Yakobu. Jwenio lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngiliikilila kunnobholela, “Liina lino nankemwa Ichilahele.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Ngatola maghanga gheniya nganchengela Bhambo Chapanga, chehemo jhu kupiikiya matambiko, ngahemba ntalo kutindii chehemo jhenio, kunyolika kwake kukibha tela nu kuleke mache ngita lita makome matato gha mache. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Peniya, ngabheka hanjo panane jhake, na ngahekita ipandeipande ng'ombi jwenio na kuibheka panane jha hanjo. Yene, ngabhalobholila bhando, “Ntweleyengane mache ihulo ncheche makajhitila panane jha litambiko lyenio lya kukomelekeya pamonga na hanjo.” Na Bheniya ngabhatenda yenie. <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Ngabhalobholila, “Mmujhilengane kabhele.” Na bheniya ngabhatenda yene pabhele. Na jwenie ngabhalobholila kabhele, ndenda kwa jhu utato. Na bheniya ngabhateila yene mala jhu utato. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Mache ngighakokwila kutindii chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko. Ade ntalo ngahulwikila mache.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Kipinde cha kimiye chukupiya matambiko nnondole Eliya ngabhandikii pa chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko gheniya, ngajhopita Bhambo Chapanga kukulonge, “Mwe ma Bhambo ma Chapanga jwa Ulahimo na Ichaka na Ichilahele, malangiya bhando deleno mwenga ndi ma Chapanga bhuku mu Ichilahele, na nenga natumiche bhino ndehi gheniya, kwa mihilo jhino. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Unyanguu ne mwe Mabhambo ma Chapanga, unyanguu kupala bhando abha bhamanye kubhehe mwenga ma Chapanga, ndi Chapanga jhimughalambula miojho jhabhe, ibhujhile kabhele.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Papalapala, mwotu gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngahulwiya na ngutiniya litambiko lyenio li kukomelekeya na hanjo na maghanga nu undope, helahela mwotu gwenio ngujhomicha mache ghoha ghighakibha mu mtalo gwenio. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Bhando bhoha pibhalolita gheniya, ngibhagwila mangukama nukulonge, “Bhambo ndi Chapanga! Chapanga ndi Chapanga!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Peniya, Eliya ngabhalobholila bhando, “Makamule akalondole bhoha bha Baale manganneka jhe hilu jhumo kunyogholoka!” Bhando ngabhakamwila bhoha, na Eliya ngabhapelika kulukemba lulubhii ku lulambo lwa Kishone, ngabhakomila kwenio.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujhomole lulange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Pughapetita gheniya, Eliya ngannobholila munahota nkolongwa Ahabo, “Nnyabhule makalye nu kunywe, ku nhwalo nijhoha kulindimila kwa hula ngolongwa.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Ahabo ngajhenda kulye nu kunywe, na Eliya ngahowika ku kilegheleghe chikitombe cha Kalimele, ngalita pahe nu kubheka muto gwake panakate jha majhugho ghake. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Pena, Eliya ngannobholila ntumiche jwake, “Ngohe, nnyende makalole upande gwa kumbwane.” Ntumiche ngajhenda kulola ngabhujha kulonge, “Kibhii jhe kilebhe kwenio.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Eliya ngannobholila ntumiche jwenio, “Nnyende kabhele ade mala pachaba.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Mala jha chaba ntumiche jwenio ngabhujha nukulonge, “Nilibhona lihunde lyandina ngita kighanja cha mundo lihobhoka kuhumii kumbwane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Eliya ngalonge, “Nnyende mukannobholele munahota nkolongwa Ahabo alenganikiye mutuka jhake jhihutwa na falache na nnyende ukajha jhanganhwibhilila jhe hula.”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Kipinde cheche, kunane ngukutanda mahunde mapile tyoo nu upepo ngupoghita, na hula ngolongwa kingomita na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngahobhokila mutuka jhake, ngabhujha ku Yezeleele. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Makakala gha Bhambo Chapanga ngughunhwikila Eliya, ngakitabha lijhoho lyake ngabhutuka kunnongolela munahota nkolongwa Ahabo nu kujhingila ku bomane ku Yezeleele.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Eliya ibhutukii ku kitombe chuku Chinae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo nganchimulila Yezebele nhwanamundo, ilebhe yoha yatehila Eliya na chabhakomita akalondole bha ichapanga Baale ku lipanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Yene, Yezebele ngatuma mundo kujhenda kwa Eliya kulonge naha, “Nilapii anda naninkoma jhe kilabho kipinde ngita chenje, ngita chimakomite akalondole bha Baale, ichapanga ingomela kutale.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya ngajhogwipa nu kutili ku muche gwa Belesheba, mu kilambo chuku Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:3">Kwenio nganneka ntumiche jwake.<verse eid="1KI 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Nambo Eliya jwenie ngatyanga lichiko limo ku njenga ngaika pankongo ghumo ukemitwa mletemo, ngatama nhwina jhake. Peniya, ngojhopa kuwe, kulonge, “Bhahe, ikwela! Nihoto jhe kabhele. Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, ntole ughome gwango, nambo ne kilebhe nacho kupeta akahoko bhango.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Peniya, Eliya ngagholwika pakiwile cha nkongo gwenio ngaghoche lughono lyoo, papa tu ntumiche kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, ngaika kumpapaha nu kunnobholela, “Nnyimuke nnabhuke.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Eliya pajhimwika ngalingukiya pande yoha na ngalibhona libumunda lilijhochwite pamwotu pamonga na bilika jha mache pahina na muto gwake. Eliya ngalila na nganywila mache, ngagholwika kabhele. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga nganhwikila kabhele, ngampapaha nu kunnobholela, “Nnyimuke nnabhuke, ku nhwalo kumijhenda kutale hake.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Eliya ngajhimwika nukulye nu kunywe. Peniya, ngatyanga kwa makakala gha chakulya chenio kwa machiko makome ncheche, kilo na muhe, ade ngaika ku Holebo yane Chinae, kitombe cha Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Kwenio ngaika palinkwembe, ngagholwika mwenio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Papa tu lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngilinhwikilila kulonge, “Eliya mihenga nike pamba?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Eliya ngajhangwila, “Ne nikipiite kwino nu kuntumikila hake mwenga, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akakomana ngondo. Akaichilahele bhililekite lilaghano lino, ngibhatilulana chehemo yukupiikiya matambiko ghino, na kwakoma akalondole bhino kwa mapanga. Nenga ndo jhunhighilile, ata yene, bhindenda kumbalaha bhangome!”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Nnyende makajheme pikitombe nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga abhandikii kupeta pena.” Peniya, ngaupeta upepo nu kutilulana kitombe nu kukajhulana maghanga nnonge jha Bhambo. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga akibha jhe mupepo gwenio, upepo ngiupeta na ngupitila nnindimilo gwa nnema. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga akibha jhe munnindimilo mwenio. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Kubhoke pa nnindimilo gwa nnema, nguhikita mwotu, nambo Bhambo Chapanga akibha jhe mu mwotu gwenio. Kubhoke pa mwotu gwenio, ngilipitila lilobhe lichokombe li unjelembo.<verse eid="1KI 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Bhahe, Eliya pajhohina lilobhe lyenio, ngakipuka lijhoho lyake kumiho, na ngapita nu kujhema pannyango gwa nkwembe. Peniya, ngajhoha lilobhe likalongela, “Eliya! Mihenga nike pamba?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Eliya ngajhangwila, “Ne nikipiite kwino nu kuntumikila hake mwenga, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akakomana ngondo. Nambo aka Ichilahele bhililekite lilaghano lino, ngabhatilulana chehemo yukupiikiya matambiko ghino na kwakoma akalondole ku mapanga. Nenga ndo jhunhighalile, ata yene, bhindenda kumbalaha bhangome!”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Nkelebhuke ku kupete ndela jhu kunjenga ade ku Damachiko. Pumpakuika kwenio, mumiminila mahuta Hezaele kupala abhehe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Alamo, yane Siliya. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Helahela mumiminila mahuta Yehu mwana jwa Nimshe, abhe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele. Na mumiminila mahuta Elisha mwana jwa Shafate jhuku Abele Meola abha nnondole chehemo jhino. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Bhahe, mundo jhojhoha jwapakunyogholoka mu kukomwa na Hazaele ku upanga, Yehu nankoma, na jhojhoha jwapakunyogholoka mu kukomwa na Yehu ku upanga, bhahe, nakomwa na Elisha. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Nambo ngohe, mmii nikihukilo cha bhando elufo chaba ku Ichilahele, bheniya bhannyinamii jhe kichapanga Baale hilu kukumbatila kinyagho chake.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya ankema Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Eliya ngabhoka kwenio, ngankole Elisha mwana jwa Shafate akalema. Peniya, pakibha na ng'ombi makome mabhele na ncheche ikalema ibheleibhele. Na ng'ombi ibhele ya Elisha ikibha unyuma hake. Eliya ngaula lijhoho lyake ngampuka Elisha. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Peniya, Elisha ngaileka ng'ombi yake nu kummutumikila Eliya na kunnobholela, “Unyeketele hote nyende nakatabhuke atate bhango na amajhe bhango, nanninkengama.” Eliya nganyangwila,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">“Nnyenda nambo ninhibhilikiya jhe.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Bhahe, Elisha nganneka Eliya, ngaibhujhii ng'ombi yake ibhele, ngaichinja ng'ombi yenio nukwateleka kukutumii mangolengole ghakongila ng'ombi pibhalemita ngita hanjo na bheniya ngabhalila. Peniya, ngabhoka nukunkengama Eliya na kuntumikila.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilehele na Akasiliya bhitenda kubulana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Kipinde chenio, Benehadade munahota nkolongwa jhuku Siliya, ngakonganicha akakakomana ngondo bhake bhoha, ngajhangatilwa akanahota akakolongwa bhange makome matato na bhabhele, bheniya ngabhaika na falache yabhe na mutuka jhihutwa na falache. Munahota nkolongwa jwenio ngajhenda kuijhobhela miche jhiku Samaliya nu kuijhingilila. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Peniya, ngatuma bhando bhake kubomane ku munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele kulonge, “Munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ilonge naha, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Maghanga ghino gha feza pamonga na chaabo ino yoha ndi yango na akaana bhino bhinakuhalala bhoha pamonga na yana ino, helahela ndi yango.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Ahabo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngalonge, “Anahota bhango manahota akolongwa nnongii tela, nenga nyeketile nimpela kila kilebhe changwete.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Peniya, akatumiche bhala ngabhabhujha kabhele kwa Ahabo kulonge, “Munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ilonge naha, ‘Nintumii akatumiche kupala umbe chaabo na feza na akaana bhino pamonga na yana ino. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Nambo kilabho kipinde ngita chenje mbakwatuma ilongoche bhango kuika kwino kuhambughana mu nyumba jhino jhi kinahota pamonga na majhumba gha akatumiche bhino, bhatole kila kilebhe chimibhona kubhehe chambone.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngabhakema ilongoche bhoha bhi kilambo ngabhalobholela, “Dola, mummona ojho, apala kutulete mang'ahe! Abhatumite akatumiche bhilonge jwenio apala akaana bhango pamonga na yana yango na feza na chaabo. Nanenga ninkanalii jhe!”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Ilongoche pamonga na bhando bhoha ngibhajhangwila, “Manganyokanikii jhe hilu kunnyeketela.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Yene, Ahabo ngabhalobholila akatumiche bha Benehadade, “Munahota nkolongwa malobholela naha, ‘Nenga nantumiche gwino nyeketile kulenganikiya ghala ghimpalita pukutumbula nambo nijheketela jhe ghunyonjekiye napandina jhe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:9">Akatumiche bhala ngabhajhenda kunnobholela munahota nkolongwa Benehadade.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Peniya, Benehadade ngatuma malobhe ghanga, “Nanikomelekeya Samaliya na kibhii jhe chikipa kuighalika chochoha kila jhumo jwa akakomana ngondo bhango nabhahotola kutola nu kubhehe ukombokelo. Ichapanga ingome hake anda nandenda jhe yene.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele ngajhangwila, “Malobholela naha anahota akolongwa Benehadade, mundo jhuna makakala ukilumbalila jhe kabula jhukubulana.”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Benehadade ngapokila malobhe gheniya kone abhii na akanahota akakolongwa ajhake bhalombine mu ichimba yabhe bhikinywa, peniya, munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ngalaghila akakomana ngondo bhake kukilenganikiya kujhenda kuujhingilila muche gwa Samaliya.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Kipinde chenio, nnondole jhumo ngannyendilila Ahabo, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele kulonge, “Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Bho, mawene akakomana ngondo bhamba chibhajholwike? Deleno, nanatenda bhalepelele nnonge jhino, na mwenga naumanya kubhehe ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Nambo Ahabo ngankonya, “Meneke jwapa kundangatila?” Nnondole ngalonge, Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, Ingombo ilongolile na kilongoche jwa akakomana ngondo jwa wilaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Nu munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngakonya, “Meneke apakutenda yene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Nnondole ngajhangwila, “Mwenga nantumbulicha!”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngabhakema bhala ingombo bhibhakibha ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo bha wilaya, bhoha bhakibha akanalome miya ibhele na makome matato nibhabhele. Peniya, ngabhakonganicha akakomana ngondo bhoha bha aka Ichilahele bhibhahighilike, jumula jhabhe bhakibha elufo chaba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Yene, piika lyobha palototohe, Ahabo na bhala akakomana ngondo bha aka Ichilahele ngabhabhoka. Kipinde chenio, Benehadade pamonga na akanahota akakolongwa makome nibhabhele bhibhakibha bhakanywa nu kulobhela mu ichimba yabhe. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Ingombo yenio bhibhakibha ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo bha wilaya, ndi ngabhalongolila, kongo Benehadade abhatumite akalingukiya kujhenda kulingulila, na bheniya ngabhannobholila kubhehe bhawene akakomana ngondo bhakaika kuhumii ku Samaliya. <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Benehadade ngalonge, “Makamule kongo bhabhii ghome, ata bhakaika kwa ngondo amu kwa uteeke.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Peniya, akakomana ngondo ingombo bhala bha wilaya, ngabhabhoka pa muche, ngabhajhenda kubulana na unyuma jhabhe, bhakengima akakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Kila jhumo ngankoma likoko jwake. Bhando bhuku Siliya, ngabhatila mbelo, na akakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele ngabhakengima. Nambo jwenio Benehadade, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Siliya, kongo ahobhokii falache jwake, nganyogholwika pamonga na bhange akakomana ngondo bhibhahobhekii falache. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Bhahe, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngabhahotwila kwabula nu kutola kwa makakala falache na mutuka jhihutwa na falache twe na ngabhakoma bhando twe bhuku Siliya.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Pughapetita gheniya, nnondole jhono nganyendilila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele nu kunnobholela, “Mpanganike maha nhwacha lyambone limpakuhenga. Nhwalo pachaka, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Siliya, nahika kabhele kubulana na mwenga.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akasiliya bhajhingilii kabhele Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Ilongoche bhibhabhii pahe jha munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ngabhalongila naha, “Ichapanga jha aka Ichilahele ndi ichapanga jhi itombe, ndi nhwalo bhakibha na makakala hake. Nambo ngohe, anda tubuline pandika, chakaka natwahotola kuliku bheniya. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Ngohe, ntende naha, mabhoye akanahota akakolongwa bhoha makome matato nibhabhele chehemo jhabhe, na kwabheka ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo chehemo jhabhe. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Nnenganikiye akakomana ngondo twe pala pintumbwila, nnepechela falache na mutuka jhihutwa na falache ghibhapukii kwa makakala. Peniya, ndi natuhola kubulana nabho na aka Ichilahele pandika. Peniya, natukola na makakala kupeta bheniya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ngakengima mawacho ghabhe, ngatenda yene.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Pukipetita tugha kipupwe, munahota nkolongwa Benehadade ngabhakema bhando bhake, na ngajhenda ku muche ghuku Afeka kubulana na aka Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Na bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhakemwa na kupelwa chilaa, tela nu kujhenda kubulana na aka Siliya. Akaichilahele ngabhabheka kighono chabhe ngabhabhonekana ngita ikunde ichokoichoko ibhele ya mbuhe, nambo aka Siliya bhakajhenii mu kilambo choha.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Peniya, mundo jwa Chapanga ngajhenda ku munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele nu kunnobholela, “Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Nhwalo aka Siliya bhilonge kubhehe nenga Chapanga ndi Chapanga jhu kuitombe hilu na Chapanga jwa pandika jhe, mbakuntenda mahotole akakomana ngondo bheniya, na mwenga nu ummanya kubhehe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele na aka Siliya, ngabhabheka kighono mwiye na mwiye kipinde cha machiko chaba, lichiko lya chaba, ndi pibhatumbwila kubulana, aka Ichilahele ngabhakoma bhando akakomana ngondo bha aka Siliya lake jhimo. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Akakomana ngondo bhibhahighalike ngabhatilila kubomane ku Afeka, kwenio ngilyagwelila lipamanda likutindikii muche, ngabhawila bhando elufo ichiline na chaba bhoha bhibhahighalike. Munahota nkolongwa Benehadade, ngatili muchumbe chimo pa muche gwenio.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Akatumiche bhake ngabhajhenda kunnobholela, “Tujhoha kubhehe akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Ichilahele ndi bhando bhina kiya hake. Deleno mutujheketele kuwala ngobho ya maghunila mukibhuno pamonga na tukitabha ng'ojhe mu mitandala, twajhendelela anahota akolongwa bhuku Ichilahele, pange jhe ihoto kunneka ghome.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Peniya, ngabhawala ngobho ya maghunila mu kibhuno nu kukitabha ng'ojhe mu mitandala jhabhe, ngibhannyendilila munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, ngibhannobholila, “Ntumiche gwino Benehadade, itenda kunnyopa kulonge, Chonde nijhopa uneke ghome.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngakonya, “Bho, amela ghome? Jwenio ndi nnongo gwango.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Akatumiche bha Benehadade ngabhalola nginyililo jhambone, kajhombe ngabhalonge, “Mwe jwenio ndi nnongo gwino!” Ahabo ngalaghila, “Nnyende makannete Benehadade kwango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Peniya, Benehadade paika, Ahabo nganhobhekiya mu mutuka jhake jhihutwa na falache.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Peniya, Benehadade ngannobholila Ahabo, “Nanimmujhichila miche jhoha tate gwango jhampokita tate gwino. Mihoto kutumbulicha chehemo jhu kuchuluchila ilebhe kwenio ku Damachiko, ngita chateila tate gwango kwenio ku Samaliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Peniya, Ahabo ngannobholila, “Kwa malaghano gheniya ghinnongii, naninneka.” Yene, ngabhabheka malaghano, nganekikiya.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnondole impe likoto Ahabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Kwa lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, jhumo pakate jha bhabholwa bha akalondole, ngannobholila nnondole, “Chonde umule kwa chilaa jhino.” Nambo jhonge jhola ngakana kumbula. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Jwenio ngalonge, “Nhwalo nkanite lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, bhahe, kipinde tu chimpakulekana na nenga, liimba lipakunkoma.” Na kwele liimba ngiliika kunkoma mundo jwenio.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Peniya, nnondole jwenio ngakongana na mundo jhonge, ngannobholila, “Chonde umule.” Mundo jwenio ngambula nu kunkocholana. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Peniya, nnondole jwenio ngabhoka nu kujhenda kunnyobhela, kunnende munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele kongo akibhilingii kitambala ku miho jhake, kupala akoto kumanyikana. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo papetita, nnondole jwenio ngankema, “Bhambo nenga natumiche bhino nakibha kikunde chu nnonge kungondo, ngaika nkomana ngondo jhumo ngilinneta mundo jhumo jwapukilwe ku makakala kungondo nu kulonge, ‘Malonde amundo bhamba, anda anyogholwike, mwe nannepa ughome gwino amu nnepa madine gha feza ipande elufo itato.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Nambo kipinde chinikibha nikahenga mahengo ghange, mundo jwenio nganyogholwika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo, jhuku Ichilahele ngajhangwila, “Yene, ndi chipakubhe luhadabulo lwino, mikihadabule mabhene.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Peniya, ndi nnondole jwenio ngabhoya kajhombe kitambala chenio kumiho jhake, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngaumanya ndi pakate jha akalondole. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Bhahe, nnondole jwenio ngannobholila Ahabo, munahota nkolongwa, “Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Ku nhwalo munnekite atile mundo jhuninnaghalikiya akomwe, bhahe, nannepa ughome gwino, kunhwalo gwa ughome gwake na ughome gwa bhando bhino kunhwalo jha ughome gwa bhando bhake.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Yene, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo, jhuku Ichilahele ngajhenda kajhake ku nyumba jha kinahota nkolongwa, kwenio ku Samaliya, kongo ate kulipyanda na lilaka hake.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Nabote inkanii kunchuluchila mujnahota nng'onda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Pughapetita gheniya, Nabote mundo jwa likabila lya Akayezileele, akibha na nngonda gwa michabibo, kwenio ku Yezileele, pahina na nyumba jha Ahabo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Samaliya. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Lichiko limo, Ahabo ngannobholila Nabote kubhehe, “Umbe nng'onda gwino gwa michabibo, ndende buchitane jha likolo, nhwalo ubhii pahina na nyumba jhango. Mwe nannimpela nng'onda ghonge gwa michabibo ghubholii hake amu anda mpahii naninnepa mbijha kwa bei, tela na nng'onda gwenio.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Nambo Nabote nganyangwila, “Nng'onda gwambekii tate gwango kubhehe gwango, Bhambo Chapanga na amambakiya kutale, kumpe mwenga uliche ghumbatite kuhumii kwa akahoko bhito.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Bhahe, Ahabo ngajhenda kajhake, kongo abhii lilaka hake nu ukokoleka kwa chela chanyangwii Nabote. Kunhwalo gwa ghala ghalongila Nabote, mundo jhuku Yezeelele kubhehe, Nimpe ng'o uliche gwa tate gwango. Yene, ngakijhebhelekiya pi kindanda na ngahila kulyegha. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Nambo Yezebele nhwana mundo Ahabo ngannyendila nu kunkonya, Bho, kilebhe ghane mmi ngolongonde na nhwilite kulyegha?<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Ahabo nganyangwila, Kunhwalo nikannobholii Nabote, mundo jwahumii ku Yezileele, Anjuluchile nng'onda gwake gwa michabibo amu anda apai nannimpela nng'onda ghonge gwa michabibo ghubholii hake. Nambo Nabote nimpe jhe nng'onda gwango gwa michabibo.<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Peniya, Yezebele nhwanamundo ngalongila, “Bho, mwe ndi manahota akolongwa bhuku Ichilahele amu mwe ndeka?” Jhimuka kajhombe nnyakile! Nenga nanimpela nng'onda gwa michabibo gwa Nabote, mundo jwa Yezileele.<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Yene, Yezebele ngajhandika baluwa kwa liina lya Ahabo, na ngabhekita unepo gwa munahota nkolongwa. Ngapelika baluwa yenio kwa akanahota na bhando bhibhamanyikana hake, bhibhatama na Nabote kwenio kubomane. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Mu baluwa yenio ikajhandikwe naha, Mpange lichiko lya kuleka kulyegha na mutamiche Nabote chehemo jha kongoloo pakate jha bhando. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Peniya, matola bhando bhabhele akakokoto bhakatame kukulolekeyana najwenio kupala bhantakalila kukulonge kubhehe Nabote annighite Chapanga na munahota nkolongwa. Peniya, mumpiya panja nu kumbula kwa maghanga ade aweghe.<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Yene, akanahota na bhando bhibhamanyikana bhange bha muche gwenio ngabhatenda ngita chalongila Yezebele ngita hela chighajhandikwe mu baluwa. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Bhahe, ngibhatangicha lichiko li kuleka kulyegha nu kummeka Nabote chehemo pi ichima pakate jha bhando. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Peniya, bhando bhala bhabhele akakokotoko ngibhatamita mwiye na Nabote, ngibhantakalila Nabote palonge jha bhando kukulonge, “Nabote annighite Chapanga na helahela annighite munahota nkolongwa.” Yene, Nabote ngahutilwa panja jha muche, ngakomitwa ku kubulwa maghanga. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ilongoche ya muche ngabhantumila ujumbe Yezebele kulonge, “Nabote akomitwe ku kubulwa maghanga.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Pajhohina tugha malobhe gheniya Yezebele kubhehe Nabote akomitwe kukubulwa maghanga, ngannobholila Ahabo, “Jhimuka! Jhenda makatole nng'onda ghola gwa Nabote, mundo jhuku Yezeleele lya michabibo, lela lyakanila kunchuluchila. Jwenio ngohe, ajhomwike.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Papa tugha Ahabo pajhohina Nabote ajhomwike, ngajhinwika kujhenda kutola nng'onda gwa michabibo gwa Nabote.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Yene, lilobhe lya Chapanga nginhiikila nnondole jwa Eliya Mtabishe kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Nnyende mukakongane na Ahabo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, jwalongocha ku Samaliya. Ngohe, abhii ku nng'onda gwa michabibo gwa Nabote, ajhawii kulitola libhehe lyake. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Munnobholela, naha ndi chalonge Bhambo Chapanga, ‘Bho, munkomite jhe mundo nukutola ilebhe yake?’ Kabhele munnobholela chalonge Bhambo Chapanga, ‘Chehemo jhela jhilambite ghimbwa myahe jha Nabote, ndi papa ghimbwa pibhapakulamba myahe jhino.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Bhahe, Ahabo ngannobholila Eliya, mwe malikoko bhango undehi kumbwitikila naha?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliya nganyangwila, “Ena, ndei kumpwitikila.” Kunhwalo mwenga mpangite njwe kutenda ghanganandela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga innobholela, ngohe, naneta mabulo kwa yana hino. Nangomelekeya ibheluko nu kuputulila kutale kubhoke kwa Ahabo, kila mwana munalome jhu kujhomolela kubhelukwa ku Ichilahele, abha hulo amu mmanda. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Dola, nyumba jhino nannitenda ngita jhela jha Yeloboamo, mwana jwa Nebate na ngita lukolo lwa Baasha mwana jwa Ahiya, nhwalo undehi mukokolikii lilaka lyango nu kwatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhatende uhakaho. <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Kabhele, Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha panane jha Yezebele, “Ntuhe gwake naulegwa na ghimbwa pahupele jha lipamanda lya muche ghuku Yezeleele. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Ena, mundo jhojhoha jwa lukolo lwa Ahabo jwapakujhomwoke ku bomane nalegwa na ghimbwa na bhala bhibhapakujhomwoke kunng'onda, nabhahonyolwa ni ijhune.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Abhii jhe mundo jwapangite kutenda ghanganandela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ngita Ahabo, jwakolwiywe na Yezebele nhwanamundo. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Akatehi kilebhe chikichimwa hake kukujhinamiii inyagho ya ichapanga ngita chibhateila Akaamole chibhabhengitwa na Bhambo Chapanga, nnonge jha bhando bhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Nambo Ahabo pajhohina malobhe gheniya, ngalandakwila ngobho yake, ngawalita majafafa na kuleka kulyegha. Ngagholwika nukukiyeka majafafa nu kulyungalyunga kone na kone ku ungolongonde.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Ndi lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga ngalinhikilila nnondole Eliya mundo jhukuhumii ku Tishibe kulonge, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Bho, nnolite namuna Ahabo chakinyenyikiya palonge jhango? Ku nhwalo akitembekiye, bhahe, naneta jhe mabulo gheniya kipinde abhii ghome, nambo kipinde chulongoche gwa mwanamundo nanakomelekeya lukolo lwa Ahabo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Nnondole Mikaya impwatalila Ahabo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Ngongu 18:2-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Kwa kipinde cha yaka itato pakibha jhe na ngondo pakate jha bhando bhuku Siliya na bhando bhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Nambo piikila chaka chu utato, munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate jhuku Yuda, ngajhenda kuntyangila munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ahabo, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngabhalobholila ilongoche bhibhabhii pahe jhake, “Bho, mimanyii jhe kubhehe Lamote Gileade ndi gwito? Na twamela tutei jhe kilebhe chochoha kubhujhicha kwito, kuhumii kwa munahota nkolongwa jhuku Siliya!” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Peniya, Ahabo ngankonyita Yehoshafate, “Bho, natujhenda nanenga kukomana kwenio ku Lamote Gileade?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Yehoshafate ngajhangwila, “Ena, ne mmi lengalenga kujhenda kukomana, mwe na nenga kilebhe chimo na helahela nchambe gwango ndi nchambe gwino na falache yango ndi hino.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate ngajhendilila kunnobholela munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, “Nambo ntumbuu hote kunkonya Bhambo Chapanga nannobholela malobhe ghane!”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Yene, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngabhakema akalondole miya ncheche ngabhakonya, “Bho, nyende nikaujhingilile muche gwa Lamote Gileade amu ngotokujhenda kuujhingilila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Bheniya ngabhajhangwila, “Nnyende mukaujhingilile muche gwenio! Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mahotole.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Nambo Yehoshafate ngakonya, “Bho, pamba abhii jhe nnondole jhonge jwa Bhambo Chapanga tuhoto kunkonya nhwalo?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Ahabo, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele nganyangwila Yehoshafate, “Abhii jhumo, ikemwa Mikaya mwana jwa Imla. Jwenio ndi tuhoto kunkonya nhwalo gwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nambo ne ninchimwa hake jwenio nhwalo ilote jhe maha kunhwalo jhango nenga, nambo ghanganandela tugha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehoshafate ngannobholila, “Itopendeka munahota nkolongwa kulonge ilebhe ngita yenio.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Yene Ahabo, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngankema ntumiche jhumo ngannobholila, “Jhomboteka! Mukankeme Mikaya mwana jwa Imla.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Kipinde chenio, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele na munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate jhuku Yuda, bhakibha bhatamite mwiighoda yabhe yu ulongoche mu ibhanja yuku pulukiya mahuno, palitangala lyuku jhingilila mu miche jhuku Samaliya pamonga na akalondole bhoha bhibhakibha bhibhalotela nnonge jhabhe. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Pakate jha akalondole bheniya, akibha nnondole jwakemitwa Sedekiya, mwana jwa Kenaana, jwenio ngatengenicha manyelo gha choma ngannobholela Ahabo kulonge, “Bhambo Chapanga ilonge, ‘Kwa manyelo ghanga, namabula aka Siliya na kwakoma.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Na akalondole bhange ngabhalotela kilebhe cheche ngabhalonge, “Nnyende, makajhingilile bhando bha muche gwa Lamote Gileade, na Bhambo Chapanga chantenda mahotole bhando bha muche gwenio.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Kipinde chenio, ntumiche jhola jwakatumitwe kujhenda kwa Mikaya, ngannobholila, “Dola, akalondole bhoha kwa pamonga bhannondolile munahota nkolongwa kubhehe nahota, chonde namwenga ntenda ngita bheniya, munnondolela mbone.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Nambo Mikaya ngajhangwila, “Nilapii kwa liina lya Bhambo Chapanga jwabhii ghome, ne nanongela ghala tugha ghapa kunnobholela Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Yene, Mikaya paheghelila nnonge jha munahota nkolongwa, Ahabo ngankonyita, “Bho, tujhende kukomana ngondo kwenio ku Lamote Gileade amu tukoto kujhenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Na Mikaya nganyangwila, “Nnyendengane na Bhambo Chapanga nantenda muhotole!”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Nambo munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngajhangwila, “Naninnapanikiya mala palegha kubhehe pimilonge nanenga ku liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, mipalwa kulonge hotuhotu?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Mikaya ngalongila, “Nabhona aka Ichilahele bhoha bhapechingine panane jha kitombe ngita mambelele ghanga nnuchajhe. Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, ‘Bhando bheniya bhakwetii jhe mundo jwakwalongocha, yene, kila mundo ajhenda kajhake ku uteeke.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Ndi, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele ngannobholila Yehoshafate, “Bho, nikannobholii jhe kubhehe mundo ojho naunotela ghambone jhe nambo ghanganandela tugha?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Peniya, Mikaya ngajhendelila kulonge, “Ajha, jhokanikiya hote lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, nikamwene Bhambo Chapanga atamite pikighoda chake chulongoche, pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha bhu kunane kwa Chapanga ghajhemite puupele jhake, lubhoko lwa lelo na lwangejha. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankonya, ‘Ghane jwapa kujhenda kunnobholela Ahabo ajhende akakijhingilile ngondo ku Lamote Gileade na akakomwe kokoko?’ Kila mundo ngajhangwila chakimanye, <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />peniya ngapitila nchuka palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngalonge, ‘Ne naninkolowa.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankonya nchuka gwenio, ‘Nantenda bhole?’ ” Na jwenio ngajhangwila, Ne nanyenda nu kwatenda akalondole bhake bhoha bhalonge uwange.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, mwenga nanhotola kunkolowa, nnyende makatende yene.<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Bhahe, Mikaya ngajhomolila kukulonge. “Bhambo Chapanga abhatehi akalondole bhino bhalonge uwange. Na Bhambo Chapanga alaghii mabhoho ghampata!”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Peniya, Sedekiya mwana jwa Kenaana, nganhweghelila Mikaya nganapwila mbalamande mu litama nu kunkonya, “Kubhoke ligha, uhuke gwa Bhambo Chapanga akaneka nenga nu kuhika kulonge na mwenga?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya ngajhangwila, “Nammangatuka lichiko lyenio, kipinde chimpa kujhingii ku chumbe kujhobha.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Na munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngampila nhwilo nkomana ngondo jwake kulonge, “Munkamule Mikaya, mumujhicha kwa Amone, nkolongwa jwa muche, na kwa Yoashe mwana jwa munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Malobholela bhammeka mu kipungo, kabhele bhampela libumunda lyandina tugha na mache, ade pimbakubhujha njelembo.”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ndi, Mikaya ngalonge, “Anda nkelehwike njelembo bhahe, umanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga akalongii jhe na nenga, na kabhele ngalonge jhokanikiya ma bhando bhoha ghanga ghinilonge!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwe kwa Ahabo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Ngongu 18:28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Bhahe, Ahabo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele, pamonga na Yehofashate munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, ngabhajhenda kujhingilii muche ghuku Lamote Gileade. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngannobholila Yehoshafate, “Nenga nawala jhe ngobho ikinahota nkolongwa kupala nangamanyikana jhe kubhehe ne na munahota nakolongwa nambo mbala mungondo, mwenga nhwala ngobho ino ya kinahaota nkolongwa.” Yene, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele ngajhenda kungondo changawala ngobho yake ikinahota nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Siliya ngailaghila ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo bhake makome matato na bhabhele bhibhalongocha mutuka ikuhutwa na falache, ngabhalobholila, “Kwenio mangakomana jhe na mundo jhojhoha nchokombe amu lindota nambo munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele tugha.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Kipinde bha akakomana ngondo bha mutuka ya ngondo bhuku Siliya pibhammonita Yehoshafate, kone awalite ngobho ikinahota nkolongwa, ngabhammanya kubhehe jwenio ndi munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele. Peniya, ngabhang'alambukila kupala kukomana nako nambo Yehoshafate ngachobhila. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Akanahota bha mutuka ya ngondo bheniya, pibhamanya kubhehe jwenio akibha munahota nkolongwa jhe jhuku Ichilahele, ngibhanneka kunyingilila. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Nambo nkomana ngondo jhumo jhuku Siliya ngahuta upinde gwake kukujhighanikii, ngilinhoma munahota nkolongwa Ahabo puilombine ngobho yake ya choma. Ahabo ngannobholila jwajhendecha mutuka yake kulonge, “Ng'alambuwe mutuka umohe pa ngondo pano! Bhangocholine!”<verse eid="1KI 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Ngondo ngijhendilila kutumbulii lukela ade kimiye, kongo Ahabo akibha ajheghemikii umutuka jhake jha ngondo kongo akalolekeyana na aka Siliya na myahe indonywika kuhumii pakilonda umutuka yenio na pihikita kimiye ngajhomwika. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Lyobha pilibhandikila kutipika, malaghalikilo ngaghatangichwa mu kighono kulonge, “Kila mundo abhujha kajhake na mu kilambo chake!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Bhahe, munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngajhomwika, malelo ghake ngibhapelika ku muche ghuku Samaliya, kwenio, ngabhanchika. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Mutuka jhake ngibhajhenda kuchuka kulitanda liku Samaliya, litanda libhajhogha akakeghe bhina ngongola. Ghimbwa ngilamba myahe jha munahota nkolongwa jwenio, ngita chililongila lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Itendwa henge ya munahota nkolongwa Ahabo yatendita pamonga nu kuchenga na majhumba kinahota nkolongwa nu kutindikiya lipamanda nu kulembelekeya kwa mino gha ndembo, na miche jhoha jhachengite, ghoha ghajhandikwe mu kitabo cha Kombokela cha munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Munahota nkolongwa Ahabo ngajhomwika na ngachikwa umambe jha akahoko mundo. Na Ahaze mwana mundo, ngabhila munahota nkolongwa chehemo jha tatemundo.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafate ilongocha ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Ngongu 20:31-21:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Mu chaka cha ncheche chu ulongoche gwa munahota nkolongwa Ahabo jhuku Ichilahele, Yehoshafate mwana jwa Asa, ngatumbuu kulongocha ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafate akibha na yaka makome matato nuhwano, patumbwila kulongocha. Ngalongwicha kuhumii ku Yeluchalemo, kwa yaka makome mabhele nu nhwano. Majhemundo akemitwa Azuba bite Shilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Mu kila kilebhe ngatenda ghambone palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ngita chatehila Asa tatemundo. Nambo akatiluline jhe chehemo jhitondobhile jhukupiikiya matambiko. Bhando ngabhajhendilila kupiya matambiko nu kututukiya ubane chehemo jhenio. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate ngabhila na uteeke na munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Itendwa yoha yateila Yehoshafate, na gwangajhoghopa gwake na ngondo yakomina, ghoha ghajhandikwe mu Kitabo cha Ngongu ya Akanahota Akakolongwa bhuku Yuda. Bhando bhobha bhibhagholwika na akanalome ajhake bhibhahighilike kipinde chu ulongoche gwa Asa, Yehoshafate ngabhabhoita pikilambo. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Helahela akanalome bhibhakibha bhagholwika na akanalome ajhabhe, bhibhahighalika mulongoche gwa Asa tatemundo, ngabhabhenga mu kilambo.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Kuhumii pena, pakibha jhe na munahota nkolongwa mu Edomo. Kilongoche gwabhe akibha mundo jwahaghulilwe na munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Munahota nkolongwa Yehoshafate ngatendekiya mele twe jhukujhenda ku Ofile kuleta chaabo, nambo ikajhawii jhe ku nhwalo ikahalibikilee kwenio ku Esione Gebele. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Yene, Ahaziya mwana jwa Ahabo ngannobholila Yehoshafate, “Maleke akatumiche bhango bhalongohane pamonga na akatumiche bhino mumele jhino.” Nambo Yehoshafate ngakanita nhwalo gwenio.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Pughapetita gheniya, Yehoshafate ngajhomwika na ngabhanchika pamambe jha muche gwa Daude hoko mundo. Mwana mundo Yeholamo, ngalongwicha pwache jha tatemundo Yehoshafate.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahaziya ilongocha ku Ichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Mu chaka cha kome na chaba cha ulongoche gwa Yehoshafate, munahota nkolongwa jhuku Yuda, Ahaziya, mwana jwa Ahabo ngatumbwila kulongocha ku Ichilahele. Ngalongwicha kwa kipinde cha yaka ibhele, kongo abhii ku Samaliya. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Ahaziya ngateila ghanganandela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngajhighanikila ghatehila Ahabo tatemundo na majhemundo Yezebele, na gwa Yeloboamo mwana jwa Nebate, jwabhatenda bhando bhuku Ichilahele, bhatende uhakaho. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Ahaziya ngantumikila nu kunnyinamila kichapanga Baale ngita chateila tatemundo, yene ngantenda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele achimwe.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>